            { "core.role.game", new[]{ "游戏可用核心", "Cores available to the game" } },
            { "core.role.count", new[]{ "{0} 线程 · {1} 个物理核", "{0} threads across {1} physical cores" } },
            { "core.howto.game", new[]{ "点击核心分配给游戏，再次点击收回，也可使用快捷按钮批量选择。", "Click a core to assign it to the game, click again to take it back, or use the quick buttons to select in bulk." } },
            { "core.guide.title", new[]{ "本页使用说明", "How to use this page" } },
            { "core.guide.open", new[]{ "使用说明", "Guide" } },
            { "core.guide.tag", new[]{ "PAVISE // CORE GUIDE", "PAVISE // CORE GUIDE" } },
            { "core.guide.s1.t", new[]{ "多数场景无需调整", "Most setups need no changes" } },
            { "core.guide.s1.d", new[]{ "建议保持默认的全核。系统调度器本就会将游戏线程置于性能核，由能效核承接后台。仅在确认游戏线程被分配到能效核并导致掉帧时，手动划分才有意义；划分不当会造成负优化。", "Keep the default of all cores. The system scheduler already places game threads on performance cores and offloads background work to efficiency cores. Manual partitioning only makes sense once you have confirmed game threads land on efficiency cores and cause frame drops; a bad partition makes things worse, not better." } },
            { "core.guide.s2.t", new[]{ "核心数量的下限", "Minimum core count" } },
            { "core.guide.s2.d", new[]{ "现代游戏的渲染、物理、音频和网络各占用独立线程，核心过少会导致卡死。建议至少保留 8 个逻辑核心，少于 2 个时不允许应用。可使用上方的快捷按钮快速选择。", "Modern games run rendering, physics, audio, and networking on separate threads; too few cores will freeze the game. Keep at least 8 logical cores; applying is blocked below 2. Use the quick buttons above to select quickly." } },
            { "core.guide.s3.t", new[]{ "需点击应用才会下发", "Nothing takes effect until you click Apply" } },
            { "core.guide.s3.d", new[]{ "勾选后仅为待应用状态，上方计数会显示为待应用，须点击右侧的应用按钮才会下发。对局进行中点击应用立即生效，无需重启游戏。", "Selections are only pending; the counter above shows them as pending until you click the Apply button on the right. Clicking Apply during a match takes effect immediately, no game restart needed." } },
            { "core.guide.hy.t", new[]{ "本机为 Intel 混合架构", "This machine is an Intel hybrid architecture" } },
            { "core.guide.hy.d", new[]{ "性能核运行游戏、能效核承接后台是 Windows 调度器的默认行为，无需手动划分。仅在任务管理器中观察到游戏线程大量落在能效核并伴随掉帧时，才建议改为仅性能核，代价是放弃能效核的算力，后台将挤占剩余核心。另外，12 至 14 代的能效核不带超线程，对其关闭超线程没有意义。", "Games on P-cores and background work on E-cores is the Windows scheduler's default behavior; no manual partitioning is needed. Only switch to P-cores only if Task Manager shows game threads landing heavily on E-cores along with frame drops — the cost is giving up the E-cores' compute, and background work will crowd the remaining cores. Also, 12th to 14th gen E-cores have no Hyper-Threading, so disabling HT on them does nothing." } },
            { "core.guide.x3d.t", new[]{ "本机为 AMD 双 CCD，其中一侧带 3D 缓存", "This machine is an AMD dual-CCD part with 3D cache on one side" } },
            { "core.guide.x3d.d", new[]{ "建议优先由 AMD 芯片组驱动和 Xbox Game Bar 判定游戏应使用的 CCD，已安装优化驱动的机器保持默认即可。仅在确认驱动未将游戏分配到大缓存 CCD 时，才手动选择缓存 CCD；少数依赖频率而非缓存的游戏可反向选择高频 CCD。切换后应观察 1% 最差帧，平均帧通常不会变化。", "Prefer letting the AMD chipset driver and Xbox Game Bar decide which CCD the game should use; machines with the optimized driver installed can stay on the default. Only pick the cache CCD manually if you have confirmed the driver is not placing the game on the large-cache CCD; the few games that depend on frequency rather than cache can pick the high-frequency CCD instead. After switching, watch the 1% low — the average frame rate usually does not change." } },
            { "core.guide.ccd.t", new[]{ "本机为 AMD 多 CCD", "This machine is an AMD multi-CCD part" } },
            { "core.guide.ccd.d", new[]{ "游戏线程分散在多块 CCD 时，跨 CCD 通信会带来额外开销，表现为帧时间毛刺。限定单块完整 CCD 可以避免该开销，代价是可用核心减半，线程数量需求高的游戏反而更卡。建议先使用全核，卡顿明显时再尝试单 CCD。不要用快捷按钮划出半块 CCD，该配置两侧收益均无法取得。", "When game threads spread across multiple CCDs, cross-CCD communication adds overhead that shows up as frame-time spikes. Restricting the game to one full CCD avoids that overhead, at the cost of halving available cores — games that need many threads will actually stutter more. Start with all cores and only try a single CCD if stutter is obvious. Do not use the quick buttons to carve out half a CCD; that configuration gets neither benefit." } },
            { "core.guide.smt.t", new[]{ "关闭超线程不等于提升", "Disabling Hyper-Threading is not a free win" } },
            { "core.guide.smt.d", new[]{ "同一物理核的两个线程共用执行单元，关闭其一确实让剩余线程独占，但现代游戏普遍能利用多线程，减半线程数通常为净损失。仅极少数老游戏或有明确实测收益时才值得使用。快捷按钮中的关超线程用于该场景，不作为默认建议。", "The two threads on one physical core share execution units; disabling one does give the remaining thread exclusive use, but modern games generally use many threads, so halving the thread count is usually a net loss. Only a handful of old games, or a change with measured benefit, justify it. The No HT quick button exists for that case and is not a default recommendation." } },
            { "core.guide.judge.t", new[]{ "效果判定方式", "How to judge the effect" } },
            { "core.guide.judge.d", new[]{ "应观察 1% 最差帧和帧时间毛刺，而非平均帧。核心划分改善的是卡顿而非帧率上限，平均帧通常不会变化。建议在同一场景、同一段路径下往返对比两次；调整后立即感到流畅多为主观错觉。", "Watch the 1% low and frame-time spikes, not the average frame rate. Core partitioning improves stutter, not the frame-rate ceiling, so the average usually does not change. Compare two runs back and forth over the same scene and the same path; feeling smoother immediately after a change is usually a subjective illusion." } },
            { "core.guide.s4.t", new[]{ "后台无需手动配置", "Background needs no manual setup" } },
            { "core.guide.s4.d", new[]{ "被重压后台的收缩落点由算法跟随当前划分实时重算，不会与分配给游戏的核心重叠，也不会拆开一对超线程。本项没有需要手动设置的部分。", "The landing cores for heavily suppressed background processes are recomputed in real time by the algorithm to follow your current partition; they never overlap the cores assigned to the game and never split a Hyper-Threading pair. There is nothing here to configure manually." } },
            { "core.guide.note", new[]{ "以上配置仅在对局中下发给游戏进程，退出游戏后自动还原，不写入注册表也不修改系统设置。关闭 Pavise 后一切恢复原状。", "These settings are only applied to the game process during a match and are restored automatically when the game exits; nothing is written to the registry and no system settings are changed. Closing Pavise returns everything to its original state." } },
            { "cpu.place.manual", new[]{ "手动", "Manual" } },
            { "core.bg.ok", new[]{ "后台 {0} 核 {1}", "Background: {0} cores {1}" } },
            { "core.bg.toofull", new[]{ "剩余核心不足 {0} 个，独占不生效", "Fewer than {0} cores remain; exclusive mode has no effect" } },
            { "core.bg.allcores", new[]{ "不分区，后台按档位处理", "No partition; background handled by tier" } },
            { "core.land.squeezed", new[]{ "重压后台落点 核 {0} · 由 {1} 个核收缩至 {2} 个", "Heavy-suppression landing cores {0}, squeezed from {1} cores down to {2}" } },
            { "core.land.plain", new[]{ "重压后台落点 核 {0}", "Heavy-suppression landing cores {0}" } },
            { "core.land.narrow", new[]{ "重压后台落点 核 {0} · 已达下限，不再收缩", "Heavy-suppression landing cores {0}, at the lower limit, no further squeeze" } },
            { "core.land.nowhole", new[]{ "重压后台落点 核 {0} · 均为超线程的另一半，不收缩", "Heavy-suppression landing cores {0}, all are HT siblings, not squeezing" } },
            { "core.land.none", new[]{ "游戏核心已占满，重压后台没有可用核心", "Game cores fill the CPU; no cores left for heavy background suppression" } },
            { "core.topo.line", new[]{ "{0} 物理核 · {1} 逻辑核 · 其中 {2} 个带超线程", "{0} physical cores, {1} logical cores, {2} with Hyper-Threading" } },
            { "core.topo.unknown", new[]{ "未知处理器", "Unknown processor" } },
            { "core.topo.default", new[]{ "未自定义", "Not customized" } },
            { "core.apply", new[]{ "应用", "Apply" } },
            { "core.state.applied", new[]{ "已生效，游戏 {0} 核，覆盖 {1} 个物理核", "Active: game on {0} cores across {1} physical cores" } },
            { "core.state.dirty", new[]{ "待应用，游戏 {0} 核，覆盖 {1} 个物理核", "Pending: game on {0} cores across {1} physical cores" } },
            { "core.state.few", new[]{ "至少需保留两个逻辑核心，否则游戏会卡死", "At least two logical cores must remain, otherwise the game will freeze" } },
            { "cpu.place.all", new[]{ "全核", "All cores" } },
            { "cpu.place.ccd", new[]{ "单 CCD", "Single CCD" } },
            { "cpu.place.performance", new[]{ "只用大核", "P-cores only" } },
            { "cpu.place.partition", new[]{ "游戏分区", "Game partition" } },
            { "cpu.place.cache", new[]{ "缓存 CCD", "Cache CCD" } },
            { "cpu.place.freq", new[]{ "高频 CCD", "Frequency CCD" } },
            { "cpu.place.pending", new[]{ "对局结束后生效", "Takes effect after the match ends" } },
            { "cpu.place.x3d.desc", new[]{ "建议保持默认的全核，由 AMD 驱动判定游戏使用哪一块。已安装 3D V-Cache 优化驱动的机器保持该档即可。怀疑驱动未将游戏分配到大缓存 CCD 时，再选择单 CCD；需要逐核指定请选择手动。所有模式均按此处设置执行。", "Keep the default of all cores and let the AMD driver decide which CCD the game uses. Machines with the 3D V-Cache optimizer driver installed can stay on this tier. Only pick Single CCD if you suspect the driver is not placing the game on the large-cache CCD; choose Manual to pick cores individually. All modes follow this setting." } },
            { "cpu.place.x3d3.desc", new[]{ "建议保持默认的全核，由 AMD 驱动判定。已安装 3D V-Cache 优化驱动的机器保持该档即可。缓存 CCD 适用于绝大多数游戏，高频 CCD 仅对少数依赖频率的游戏有效。切换后应观察 1% 最差帧，平均帧通常不会变化。切换即时生效，对局中会等待对局结束。", "Keep the default of all cores and let the AMD driver decide. Machines with the 3D V-Cache optimizer driver installed can stay on this tier. The cache CCD suits the vast majority of games; the frequency CCD only helps the few games that depend on clock speed. After switching, watch the 1% low — the average frame rate usually does not change. Switching takes effect immediately; during a match it waits until the match ends." } },
            { "cpu.place.ccd.desc", new[]{ "建议保持默认的全核。单 CCD 限定游戏只使用一块完整处理器 Die，可避免跨 CCD 通信开销，代价是可用核心减半，线程数量需求高的游戏在全核下更稳定。卡顿明显时再尝试单 CCD；需要逐核指定请选择手动。所有模式均按此处设置执行。", "Keep the default of all cores. Single CCD restricts the game to one complete processor die, avoiding cross-CCD communication overhead at the cost of halving available cores; games that need many threads are more stable on all cores. Try Single CCD only when stutter is obvious; choose Manual to pick cores individually. All modes follow this setting." } },
            { "cpu.place.ccd3.desc", new[]{ "建议保持默认的全核。选定一块后游戏只使用该块，后台和中断归入另一块，可避免跨 CCD 通信开销，代价是可用核心减半。何者更优因机而异，两块均可尝试。切换后应观察 1% 最差帧，平均帧通常不会变化。切换即时生效，对局中会等待对局结束。", "Keep the default of all cores. Once a die is selected the game uses only that die, with background work and interrupts moved to the other, avoiding cross-CCD communication overhead at the cost of halving available cores. Which die is better varies by machine; try both. After switching, watch the 1% low — the average frame rate usually does not change. Switching takes effect immediately; during a match it waits until the match ends." } },
            { "cpu.place.hybrid.desc", new[]{ "建议保持默认的全核。系统调度器本就将游戏线程置于 P 核、由 E 核承接后台，多数情况下即为最优。仅在确认游戏线程被分配到 E 核并导致掉帧时才选择只用大核，该配置会放弃 E 核的算力。需要逐核指定请选择手动。所有模式均按此处设置执行。", "Keep the default of all cores. The system scheduler already places game threads on P-cores and offloads background work to E-cores, which is optimal in most cases. Only choose P-cores only if you have confirmed game threads land on E-cores and cause frame drops; that configuration gives up the E-cores' compute. Choose Manual to pick cores individually. All modes follow this setting." } },
            { "cpu.place.generic.desc", new[]{ "默认全核。游戏分区会保留若干核心给后台，游戏不占用这些核心，适用于后台程序较多、边挂载任务边游戏的机器；系统较为干净时保持全核即可。改善的是卡顿和 1% 最差帧，平均帧通常不会变化。需要逐核指定请选择手动。所有模式均按此处设置执行。", "All cores by default. Game partition reserves a few cores for background work that the game will not touch — good for machines that run many background programs or game while other tasks run; a fairly clean system can stay on all cores. This improves stutter and the 1% low; the average frame rate usually does not change. Choose Manual to pick cores individually. All modes follow this setting." } },
            { "cpu.place.unavailable.desc", new[]{ "本机物理核心较少，划分后台核心的算力损失超过隔离收益，因此不提供游戏分区档。需要逐核指定请选择手动。所有模式均按此处设置执行。", "This machine has few physical cores; the compute lost by carving out background cores outweighs the isolation benefit, so the Game partition tier is not offered. Choose Manual to pick cores individually. All modes follow this setting." } },
            { "v15.policy.custom", new[]{ "自定义预设细节", "Custom preset details" } },
            { "v15.policy.extras", new[]{ "会话附加动作，所有模式生效", "Session extras, active in all modes" } },
            { "v15.boost.sub", new[]{ "同时提升游戏进程的 CPU 优先级、IO 优先级和内存页优先级，并将其标记为显卡侧的高优先级客户端。目标仅限实际渲染画面的进程，启动器、游戏平台和更新器不会被误判为游戏。提优在对局中下发，退出后即还原。", "Raises the game process's CPU priority, IO priority, and memory page priority together, and marks it as a high-priority client on the GPU side. Targets only the process actually rendering the picture; launchers, game platforms, and updaters are never mistaken for the game. The boost is applied during a match and restored on exit." } },
            { "v15.anticheat.sub", new[]{ "与游戏模式无关，仅作用于下列反作弊程序。", "Independent of game mode; applies only to the anti-cheat programs listed below." } },
            { "v14.master", new[]{ "Pavise 智能守护", "Pavise Smart Guardian" } },
            { "preset.standard", new[]{ "智能", "Smart" } },
            { "preset.competitive", new[]{ "专注", "Focus" } },
            { "preset.custom", new[]{ "自定义", "Custom" } },
            { "sec.theme", new[]{ "模式主题色", "Mode accent colors" } },
            { "theme.hint", new[]{ "为智能、专注、自定义三种模式分别指定强调色，「默认」恢复内置配色。切换到对应模式时即时生效。", "Assign an accent color to each of the Smart, Focus, and Custom modes; Default restores the built-in palette. Takes effect the moment you switch to that mode." } },
            { "v14.cpu.topology", new[]{ "CPU 调度拓扑", "CPU scheduling topology" } },
            { "v14.boost.status", new[]{ "游戏提权状态", "Game boost status" } },
            { "v14.boost.disabled", new[]{ "游戏提优已关闭", "Game boost is off" } },
            { "v14.boost.wait", new[]{ "等待游戏画面输出", "Waiting for game frame output" } },
            { "v14.boost.no.renderer", new[]{ "已识别启动器，等待游戏本体", "Launcher detected, waiting for the game itself" } },
            { "v14.boost.applying", new[]{ "正在提速 {0}", "Boosting {0}" } },
            { "v14.boost.verified", new[]{ "已生效 {0}\r\n提速已写入系统并通过回读确认", "Active {0}\r\nBoost written to the system and confirmed by read-back" } },
            { "v14.boost.protected", new[]{ "{0} 受反作弊保护，优先级无法修改\r\n可在策略页开启后备提优，下次进入游戏由系统直接赋予高优先级，其余优化照常生效", "{0} is protected by anti-cheat; its priority cannot be changed\r\nEnable fallback boost on the Policy page and the system will grant high priority directly the next time the game starts; all other optimizations still apply" } },
            { "v14.bg.master", new[]{ "后台压制 总开关", "Background suppression master switch" } },
            { "v14.bg.master.sub", new[]{ "控制是否调整后台程序的优先级、效率模式、IO 与内存页优先级。关闭后不会修改任何后台程序，下方相关开关随之全部失效。无论开关状态如何，游戏本体、反作弊、系统核心组件、其他用户账户下的进程以及白名单中的程序，任何时候都不在压制范围内。", "Controls whether background programs' priority, efficiency mode, IO, and memory page priority are adjusted. When off, no background program is touched and all related switches below are disabled. Regardless of this switch, the game itself, anti-cheat, core system components, processes under other user accounts, and whitelisted programs are never within suppression scope." } },
            { "v14.preset.forced.on", new[]{ "预设强制开", "Forced on by preset" } },
            { "v14.preset.forced.off", new[]{ "预设强制关", "Forced off by preset" } },
            { "v14.anticheat.boundary", new[]{ "反作弊仅在此处配置，不随游戏模式变化", "Anti-cheat is configured only here and does not change with game mode" } },
            { "v14.anticheat.master.sub", new[]{ "仅作用于下列反作弊程序，不会将游戏平台和登录器判定为反作弊。", "Applies only to the anti-cheat programs listed below; game platforms and launchers are never treated as anti-cheat." } },
            { "v14.cpu.multigroup", new[]{ "多处理器组，CPU Sets 跨组调度，游戏核心范围可手动选择", "Multiple processor groups; CPU Sets schedule across groups; the game core range can be selected manually" } },
            { "v14.anticheat", new[]{ "反作弊专项", "Anti-cheat specifics" } },
            { "v14.cpu.hybrid", new[]{ "混合架构，默认全核，游戏核心范围可切换为只用大核或逐核手动指定", "Hybrid architecture; all cores by default; the game core range can switch to P-cores only or per-core manual selection" } },
            { "v14.cpu.x3d", new[]{ "非对称 L3（X3D），默认全核，可手动切换至大缓存 CCD", "Asymmetric L3 (X3D); all cores by default; can switch manually to the large-cache CCD" } },
            { "v14.cpu.generic", new[]{ "{0} 逻辑处理器，智能只压抢资源的，专注全体降档并隔离抢资源的", "{0} logical processors; Smart clamps only resource hogs, Focus drops everything to eco and isolates the hogs" } },
            { "detect.learned", new[]{ "命中已确认的渲染进程", "Matched a confirmed renderer process" } },
            { "detect.fullscreen", new[]{ "前台全屏画面", "Foreground fullscreen frame" } },
            { "detect.window", new[]{ "所选 EXE 自带前台窗口", "Selected EXE has its own foreground window" } },
            { "detect.gpu", new[]{ "GPU 3D 引擎主导 {0}%", "GPU 3D engine dominant at {0}%" } },
            { "detect.gpu.pending", new[]{ "窗口化候选，等待 GPU 证据确认", "Windowed candidate, awaiting GPU evidence" } },
            { "detect.forced", new[]{ "强制接管，进程存在即判定为对局", "Forced takeover: process presence counts as a match" } },
            { "title.noelev", new[]{ "未提权，压制类功能无效", "Not elevated; suppression features are inactive" } },
            { "title.admin", new[]{ "管理员权限", "Administrator" } },
            { "title.guard", new[]{ "守护中 {0}", "Guarding {0}" } },
            { "title.idle", new[]{ "待命", "Standby" } },

            { "btn.browse", new[]{ "浏览 exe", "Browse exe" } },
            { "btn.remove", new[]{ "移除选中", "Remove selected" } },

            { "st.off", new[]{ "已关闭", "Off" } },
            { "st.mon", new[]{ "监控中，未检测到列表内的游戏", "Monitoring; no game from the list detected" } },
            { "st.armed", new[]{ "已就位 {0}，进入对局画面自动接管", "Armed for {0}; takes over automatically when the match screen appears" } },
            { "st.grace", new[]{ "{0} 已退出，剩余 {1} 秒宽限，后台已先行还原，重新进入游戏可无缝续接", "{0} exited; {1}s grace remaining; background already restored, re-entering the game resumes seamlessly" } },
            { "st.active", new[]{ "激活中 {0}，已压制 {1} 个进程", "Active on {0}; {1} processes suppressed" } },
            { "st.boost", new[]{ "已提优 {0} {1}", "Boosted {0} {1}" } },
            { "st.hp", new[]{ "高性能电源", "High-performance power" } },
            { "st.pr", new[]{ "电源就绪", "Power ready" } },

            { "tame.toggle", new[]{ "反作弊压制 总开关", "Anti-cheat suppression master switch" } },
            { "set.nvmax", new[]{ "NVIDIA 电源模式 最高性能优先", "NVIDIA power mode: prefer maximum performance" } },
            { "set.nvmax.n", new[]{ "驱动默认按负载自适应调频，从低频升至满频需要一段时间，期间帧数不稳定。本项使显卡在对局期间保持高频，省去升频过程，代价是功耗和温度全程更高。散热能力不足的笔记本会更早触及温度墙，结果可能低于不开启。关闭后恢复原状。", "By default the driver scales clocks with load, and ramping from low to full clocks takes a moment, during which frame rates are unstable. This keeps the GPU at high clocks throughout the match, skipping the ramp-up, at the cost of higher power draw and temperature the whole time. Laptops with weak cooling will hit the thermal limit sooner and may end up worse than leaving this off. Turning it off restores the original state." } },
            { "set.nv.none", new[]{ "未检测到 NVIDIA 驱动，本项停用", "No NVIDIA driver detected; this item is disabled" } },
            { "set.nvll", new[]{ "NVIDIA 低延迟", "NVIDIA low latency" } },
            { "set.nvll.n", new[]{ "驱动默认允许 CPU 为显卡预排多帧，排队越多，从操作到画面呈现的间隔越长。「低延迟」将队列限制为一帧；「超低延迟 Ultra」在此之上让 CPU 恰好赶在显卡取帧前才提交，显卡满载时延迟进一步下降，NVIDIA 官方数据最多再降三成。两档都只对 DX9 与 DX11 游戏生效，DX12 和 Vulkan 由游戏自管队列；游戏内建 Reflex 时以 Reflex 为准。显卡未跑满时收益趋零。选择关即恢复原状。", "By default the driver lets the CPU queue several frames ahead for the GPU; the longer the queue, the longer the gap from input to on-screen result. \"Low latency\" limits the queue to one frame; \"Ultra low latency\" goes further, having the CPU submit just before the GPU picks up the frame, cutting latency further when the GPU is fully loaded — up to another third by NVIDIA's own figures. Both tiers only affect DX9 and DX11 games; DX12 and Vulkan games manage their own queues, and a game's built-in Reflex takes precedence. Benefit approaches zero when the GPU is not fully loaded. Selecting Off restores the original state." } },
            { "nvll.on", new[]{ "低延迟", "Low latency" } },
            { "nvll.ultra", new[]{ "超低延迟 Ultra", "Ultra low latency" } },
            { "set.nvsmooth", new[]{ "NVIDIA Smooth Motion 驱动插帧", "NVIDIA Smooth Motion driver frame generation" } },
            { "set.nvsmooth.n", new[]{ "驱动级 AI 插帧，在两张真实画面之间推算一帧，帧率视觉上接近翻倍，不需要游戏支持 DLSS 帧生成。代价是输入延迟会增加约半帧到一帧，竞技对战游戏不要开启，适合单机大作追求观感。基础帧率低于 60 时插出的帧瑕疵明显，建议先把画质调到基础帧稳定再开。对 DX11、DX12 和 Vulkan 游戏生效。关闭后恢复原状。", "Driver-level AI frame generation: it infers one frame between two real ones, visually near-doubling the frame rate, with no need for the game to support DLSS Frame Generation. The cost is roughly half a frame to one frame of added input latency — do not enable it in competitive games; it suits single-player titles chasing visual smoothness. Below 60 base FPS the generated frames show obvious artifacts, so tune quality settings for a stable base frame rate first. Works with DX11, DX12, and Vulkan games. Turning it off restores the original state." } },
            { "set.nvsmooth.nogpu", new[]{ "需要 RTX 40 或 50 系显卡，本机显卡不支持驱动插帧", "Requires an RTX 40 or 50 series GPU; this machine's GPU does not support driver frame generation" } },
            { "set.nvsmooth.old", new[]{ "驱动版本过低，需要 {0} 以上，升级后可用", "Driver too old; requires {0} or later, available after upgrading" } },
            { "set.nvshader", new[]{ "NVIDIA 着色器缓存无上限", "NVIDIA shader cache without size limit" } },
            { "set.nvshader.n", new[]{ "驱动默认限制着色器磁盘缓存的总大小，缓存装满后会淘汰旧游戏的编译产物，下次再玩时重新编译，表现为进图后一段时间的连续卡顿。本项对该游戏解除上限，编译过的着色器长期保留，代价是占用更多磁盘空间。虚幻 5 等着色器数量巨大的游戏收益最明显。关闭后恢复默认上限。", "By default the driver caps the total size of the on-disk shader cache; once full, older games' compiled shaders are evicted and must be recompiled next time you play, showing up as sustained stutter for a while after loading in. This removes the cap for the game so compiled shaders are kept long-term, at the cost of more disk space. Games with huge shader counts, such as Unreal Engine 5 titles, benefit most. Turning it off restores the default cap." } },
            { "frl.off", new[]{ "关", "Off" } },
            { "dlss.latest", new[]{ "最新", "Latest" } },
            { "set.nvdlss", new[]{ "DLSS 换新算法", "DLSS model swap-in" } },
            { "set.nvdlss.n", new[]{ "仅在游戏内已开启 DLSS 时有效。游戏内置的算法版本停留在发布时的状态，本项由驱动替换为当前最新版本，画面更清晰，拖影和锯齿更少，老游戏同样适用。少数游戏对版本有校验，替换后可能花屏或无法启动，遇到时选择关即恢复原状。", "Only effective when DLSS is already enabled in the game. The model version bundled with a game is frozen at release; this has the driver substitute the current latest version — sharper image, less ghosting and aliasing, and it works for older games too. A few games validate the version and may glitch or fail to launch after the swap; if that happens, selecting Off restores the original state." } },
            { "set.nvdlss.old", new[]{ "驱动版本过低，需要 566.14 以上，升级后可用", "Driver too old; requires 566.14 or later, available after upgrading" } },
            { "set.nvdlss.nogpu", new[]{ "本机显卡非 RTX，不具备 DLSS 超分能力，本项不可用。GTX 及更早型号均不支持。", "This machine's GPU is not an RTX card and lacks DLSS upscaling capability, so this item is unavailable. GTX and earlier models are not supported." } },
            { "set.nvrebar", new[]{ "ReBAR 强制开启", "Force ReBAR on" } },
            { "set.nvrebar.n", new[]{ "未启用 ReBAR 时，CPU 每次只能通过一个 256MB 的窗口访问显存，启用后可一次访问整块。NVIDIA 仅对经过自身测试的部分游戏默认开启，名单外一律关闭。本项对名单外的游戏也强制开启：部分游戏帧数有数个百分点的提升，个别游戏反而掉帧或花屏，无法预测，建议对同一游戏开关各测一局。前提是 BIOS 中同样需要开启。关闭后恢复原状。", "Without ReBAR, the CPU can only access VRAM through a 256MB window at a time; with it, the whole pool is accessible at once. NVIDIA enables it by default only for games it has tested itself and disables it for everything else. This forces it on for games outside that list: some games gain a few percent in frame rate, a few actually drop frames or glitch — it cannot be predicted, so test the same game one match on, one match off. It also requires being enabled in the BIOS. Turning it off restores the original state." } },
            { "set.nvrebar.det.on", new[]{ "本机已开启，窗口 {0}", "Enabled on this machine, window {0}" } },
            { "set.nvrebar.det.off", new[]{ "本机未开启，窗口 {0}，需在 BIOS 中开启后才有效", "Not enabled on this machine, window {0}; must be enabled in the BIOS to take effect" } },
            { "set.nvansel", new[]{ "禁止 Ansel 注入游戏", "Block Ansel injection into games" } },
            { "set.nvansel.n", new[]{ "Ansel 是 NVIDIA 注入游戏进程的截图组件，需要在游戏内挂钩，既占用常驻开销，也是反作弊误报的常见来源。本项阻止其加载，代价是 NVIDIA 覆盖层中的照片模式不可用，游戏自带截图和录制不受影响。关闭后恢复原状。", "Ansel is an NVIDIA screenshot component injected into game processes; it hooks into the game, adding constant overhead and being a common source of anti-cheat false positives. This blocks it from loading, at the cost of the photo mode in the NVIDIA overlay; the game's own screenshots and recording are unaffected. Turning it off restores the original state." } },
            { "v16.spec.cpu", new[]{ "处理器", "Processor" } },
            { "v16.spec.gpu", new[]{ "显示适配器", "Display adapter" } },
            { "v16.spec.mem", new[]{ "系统内存", "System memory" } },
            { "v16.device.hags.on", new[]{ "已开启", "On" } },
            { "rep.log.none", new[]{ "日志为空", "Log is empty" } },
            { "rep.clear.log", new[]{ "清除日志", "Clear log" } },
            { "rep.clear.ask", new[]{ "清空运行日志\r\n\r\nPavise.log 将被清空，已归档的 Pavise.log.old 不受影响。", "Clear the run log\r\n\r\nPavise.log will be emptied; the archived Pavise.log.old is unaffected." } },
            { "gm.standby", new[]{ "内存吃紧时清理待机内存", "Purge standby memory when memory runs low" } },
            { "gm.standby.sub", new[]{ "对局中持续监测可用内存，仅当可用物理内存低于 15% 时清理一次低优先级待机页，并设有 45 秒冷却以防止反复触发。仅清理系统判定最不可能再次使用的那部分缓存，不清空整个待机列表，也不丢弃有价值的文件缓存。8 至 16GB 内存紧张时可缓解帧时间抖动；内存充裕的机器几乎不会触发。默认开启。", "Continuously monitors available memory during a match and purges low-priority standby pages once only when available physical memory falls below 15%, with a 45-second cooldown to prevent repeated triggering. It clears only the portion of cache the system deems least likely to be reused, never the whole standby list, and discards no valuable file cache. On machines with 8 to 16GB under pressure it eases frame-time jitter; machines with ample memory rarely trigger it. Enabled by default." } },
            { "gm.pausewu", new[]{ "对局期间暂停 Windows 更新", "Pause Windows Update during matches" } },
            { "gm.pausewu.sub", new[]{ "避免对局中途开始下载和安装，导致硬盘与 CPU 被大量占用并造成明显卡顿。暂停的是更新动作本身，不修改系统中的更新设置和策略，退出对局后自动恢复。", "Prevents downloads and installs from starting mid-match, which would hammer the disk and CPU and cause obvious stutter. Only the update activity itself is paused; system update settings and policies are untouched, and everything resumes automatically after the match ends." } },
            { "set.gmguard", new[]{ "Windows 游戏模式守护", "Windows Game Mode guardian" } },
            { "set.gmguard.n", new[]{ "游戏模式的实际作用是阻止对局中的驱动安装和重启提示，而非提升帧数。它常被旧版优化教程当作负优化关闭。本项将其恢复为开启状态，若本就开启则不做任何操作。立即生效，可恢复。", "Game Mode's actual job is to block driver installs and restart prompts during a match, not to raise frame rates. Old optimization guides often disabled it as a supposed negative. This restores it to on, and does nothing if it is already on. Takes effect immediately; reversible." } },
            { "set.cfgoff", new[]{ "关闭游戏本体的控制流保护 CFG", "Disable Control Flow Guard for game executables" } },
            { "set.cfgoff.n", new[]{ "为检测到运行的游戏本体写入 IFEO 缓解策略，强制关闭控制流保护。CFG 是编译进程序的间接调用校验，逐次调用都有开销，重度加壳的网游尤其明显。本项只改动同一位域里的 CFG 一位，保留用户已有的其它缓解设置，下次启动该游戏时生效，关闭开关即逐个还原", "Writes an IFEO mitigation policy to detected game executables, force-disabling Control Flow Guard. CFG is an indirect-call check compiled into the program, costing a little on every such call — most visible in heavily packed online games. This touches only the CFG bit within the shared bitfield, preserving your other mitigation settings; it takes effect the next time you launch that game, and flipping the switch off restores each one. Cost: it lowers that game's defense against memory attacks, and networked clients have been remotely exploited before. Not recommended for competitive kernel anti-cheat titles unless you need it. Off by default." } },
            { "cfgoff.on", new[]{ "已开启。Pavise 会在检测到游戏本体运行后写入关闭策略，下次启动该游戏时生效。", "Enabled. Pavise writes the disable policy once it detects the game executable running; it takes effect the next time you launch that game." } },
            { "cfgoff.off", new[]{ "已关闭并还原已写入的游戏本体控制流保护策略。", "Disabled; the Control Flow Guard policies written to game executables have been restored." } },
            { "cfgoff.restorefail", new[]{ "部分游戏本体的策略未能还原，已保留登记待下次重试。", "Some game executable policies could not be restored; the record is kept for a later retry." } },
            { "netthrottle.ok", new[]{ "当前值 {0} 在正常范围内，无需校正", "Current value {0} is within the normal range; no correction needed" } },
            { "netthrottle.broken", new[]{ "当前值 {0} 超出有效范围，建议校正回系统默认值 10", "Current value {0} is outside the valid range; correcting back to the system default of 10 is recommended" } },
            { "set.clock", new[]{ "平台时钟校正", "Platform timer correction" } },
            { "clock.ok", new[]{ "启动配置干净，无陈旧的时钟覆盖，无需校正", "Boot configuration is clean, no stale timer overrides; no correction needed" } },
            { "clock.repaired", new[]{ "已校正，启动配置恢复为系统默认计时", "Corrected; boot configuration restored to system default timing" } },
            { "clock.broken", new[]{ "检测到陈旧覆盖 {0}，建议校正", "Stale override {0} detected; correction recommended" } },
            { "netthrottle.absent", new[]{ "当前未设置该值，即为系统默认，无需校正", "The value is not set, which is the system default; no correction needed" } },
            { "quantum.absent", new[]{ "当前未设置该值，即为系统默认，无需校正", "The value is not set, which is the system default; no correction needed" } },
            { "quantum.short", new[]{ "短时间片", "short slice" } },
            { "quantum.long", new[]{ "长时间片", "long slice" } },
            { "quantum.variable", new[]{ "可变", "variable" } },
            { "quantum.fixed", new[]{ "定长", "fixed" } },
            { "quantum.ok", new[]{ "当前值 {0}，前台加权已是微软文档定义的最大档，解码为 {1}（前台:后台）。高四位微软无官方文档，本项不据此判断", "Current value {0}. The foreground boost is already at the Maximum level Microsoft documents; decoded as {1} (foreground:background). The upper four bits have no official Microsoft documentation and are not used as a basis for judgment here" } },
            { "quantum.weak", new[]{ "当前值 {0}，前台加权低于微软文档定义的最大档，解码为 {1}（前台:后台）。前台程序每次拿到 CPU 的连续运行时间不及后台应有的倍数，多半是被别的工具改过。校正只改这两位，其余位原样保留", "Current value {0}. The foreground boost is below the Maximum level Microsoft documents; decoded as {1} (foreground:background). Foreground programs get less consecutive CPU time relative to background than they should, which usually means another tool changed it. Correcting it touches only those two bits and leaves the rest as they are" } },
            { "quantum.undocumented", new[]{ "当前值 {0}，前台加权位取的是微软未文档化的取值，解码为 {1}（前台:后台）。微软只定义了 0 1 2 三档，取 3 时内核实际怎么处理没有保证，各版本可能不同。校正把这两位改成有文档的最大档，该值其余位原样保留", "Current value {0}. The foreground boost bits hold a value Microsoft never documented; decoded as {1} (foreground:background). Microsoft defines only 0, 1 and 2, and what the kernel actually does with 3 is not guaranteed and may differ between versions. Correcting it sets those two bits to the documented maximum and leaves every other bit as it is" } },
            { "fth.off", new[]{ "本机容错堆功能已关闭，系统不会给任何程序挂堆垫片。", "The fault tolerant heap is disabled on this machine, so the system will not attach a heap shim to any program." } },
            { "fth.clean", new[]{ "未发现被挂堆垫片的程序，无需处理。", "No program was found carrying a heap shim; no action required." } },
            { "fth.cleared", new[]{ "已由 Pavise 解除，垫片文件保留在原处未删除，可随时还原。", "Already removed by Pavise. The shim file is left in place and untouched, so this can be reverted at any time." } },
            { "fth.hit", new[]{ "系统已给 {0} 挂上容错堆垫片。", "The system has attached a fault-tolerant-heap shim to {0}." } },
            { "fth.hit.why", new[]{ "系统已给 {0} 挂上容错堆垫片，触发条件是该程序在 {1} 分钟内以堆损坏或 ntdll 访问违例的方式崩溃了 {2} 次。", "The system has attached a fault-tolerant-heap shim to {0}. It triggers when that program crashes {2} times within {1} minutes via heap corruption or an ntdll access violation." } },
            { "audit.fth.confirm", new[]{ "解除容错堆垫片？\r\n\r\n容错堆是崩溃缓解手段：它给反复崩溃的程序套一层堆保护，代价是每次堆分配和释放都多一点开销。解除后该程序的堆恢复原生速度，但原本被缓解掉的崩溃可能重新出现。\r\n\r\nPavise 只做两件事：把该程序加入系统的容错堆排除名单，并摘掉注册表里指向垫片的那个值。垫片文件本身不删除，保留在原处作为还原源。两项都可还原。\r\n\r\n确认解除？", "Remove the fault-tolerant-heap shim?\r\n\r\nThe fault tolerant heap is a crash mitigation: it wraps a repeatedly crashing program's heap in extra protection at the cost of a little overhead on every allocation and free. Removing it restores native heap speed, but the crashes it was masking may return.\r\n\r\nPavise does exactly two things: it adds the program to the system's fault-tolerant-heap exclusion list, and it removes the registry value pointing at the shim. The shim file itself is not deleted — it stays in place as the source for reverting. Both steps are reversible.\r\n\r\nRemove it?" } },
            { "set.devpower", new[]{ "禁止网卡节能断电", "Block NIC power-saving shutdown" } },
            { "set.devpower.n", new[]{ "系统在空闲一段时间后会对网卡断电以节省电量，再次产生流量时需先唤醒，该期间的数据包会被丢弃，表现为无征兆的单次卡顿并伴随掉线重连，笔记本无线网络上尤为明显。本项仅修改该设置，不涉及网卡的其他高级选项。立即生效，可恢复。", "After a period of idleness the system powers down the network adapter to save energy; the next traffic must first wake it, and packets in that window are dropped — showing up as a sudden one-off stutter with disconnect and reconnect, especially on laptop Wi-Fi. This changes only that setting and touches none of the adapter's other advanced options. Takes effect immediately; reversible." } },
            { "set.accesskeys", new[]{ "辅助功能按键拦截", "Accessibility key interception" } },
            { "set.accesskeys.n", new[]{ "筛选键按微软自身的定义即为让键盘忽略短促和重复的击键，开启状态相当于在输入路径上主动加入一段延迟，是键鼠环节中唯一能挽回两位数毫秒的软件项。多数用户是在游戏中长按 Shift 被提示框误开启的。本项清除筛选键、粘滞键和切换键的生效位及其触发热键，避免后续再次误开。无需管理员权限，无需重启。需要使用这些辅助功能的用户请勿开启。可还原。", "Filter Keys, by Microsoft's own definition, makes the keyboard ignore brief and repeated keystrokes — when on, it effectively inserts a delay into the input path, and it is the one software item in the keyboard-mouse chain that can recover double-digit milliseconds. Most users enabled it accidentally through the prompt while holding Shift in a game. This clears the active bits and trigger hotkeys for Filter Keys, Sticky Keys, and Toggle Keys so they cannot be accidentally enabled again. No administrator rights or reboot needed. Users who need these accessibility features should leave this off. Can be restored." } },
            { "set.windowedopt", new[]{ "窗口化游戏优化", "Optimizations for windowed games" } },
            { "windowedopt.oldos", new[]{ "这一项由 Windows 11 提供，本机系统版本不支持，开关已停用。", "This feature is provided by Windows 11; this machine's OS version does not support it, so the switch is disabled." } },
            { "set.windowedopt.n", new[]{ "微软官方背书的降延迟机制，旧 DX10 DX11 游戏窗口化时改走翻转呈现模型，还解锁自动 HDR 与可变刷新率。全屏独占游戏不受影响，个别依赖旧呈现路径的老游戏若画面异常，关掉即可。只写当前用户的显卡偏好设置，无需管理员权限。重启游戏后生效，可恢复。", "A latency-reduction mechanism officially backed by Microsoft: old DX10/DX11 games in windowed mode switch to the flip presentation model, which also unlocks Auto HDR and variable refresh rate. Exclusive-fullscreen games are unaffected; if a rare old game that depends on the legacy presentation path glitches, just turn it off. Writes only the current user's graphics preferences and needs no administrator rights. Takes effect after restarting the game; reversible." } },
            { "set.hidpower", new[]{ "禁止键鼠设备选择性暂停", "Block selective suspend for keyboard and mouse" } },
            { "set.hidpower.n", new[]{ "系统会对空闲的 USB 设备断电挂起，键鼠也在其列。微软的选择性暂停文档承认退出挂起的延迟会表现为画面上的停顿。本项针对的是空闲一段时间后首次操作的延迟，持续操作时的延迟不受影响，不改善稳态延迟。台式机没有代价，笔记本需以续航为代价。仅涉及键鼠所在的 USB 链路和集线器，不涉及 U 盘和声卡。重启或重插设备后生效，可恢复。", "The system powers down and suspends idle USB devices, keyboards and mice included. Microsoft's selective-suspend documentation acknowledges that resume-from-suspend latency can show up as an on-screen pause. This targets the delay of the first input after a period of idleness; latency during continuous use is unaffected, and steady-state latency does not improve. Costs nothing on a desktop; laptops pay in battery life. Affects only the USB path and hubs hosting the keyboard and mouse, not flash drives or audio devices. Takes effect after a reboot or replugging the device; reversible." } },
            { "tame.lvl.eco", new[]{ "温和", "Gentle" } },
            { "tame.lvl.res", new[]{ "均衡", "Balanced" } },
            { "tame.lvl.iso", new[]{ "强力", "Strong" } },

            { "gs.moff", new[]{ "总开关关闭", "Master switch off" } },
            { "gs.noff", new[]{ "未开启", "Not enabled" } },
            { "gs.noproc", new[]{ "未检测到进程", "No process detected" } },
            { "gs.thr", new[]{ "已压制 {0}", "Suppressed {0}" } },
            { "gs.prot", new[]{ "另有 {0} 个受内核保护，无法压制", "{0} more are kernel-protected and cannot be suppressed" } },

            { "white.page.sub", new[]{ "此处列出的程序永远不会被压制。将 EXE 或快捷方式拖入即可添加，作用范围自动判定。", "Programs listed here are never suppressed. Drag an EXE or shortcut in to add it; the scope is determined automatically." } },
            { "white.page.empty", new[]{ "白名单为空\r\n将程序拖入，或点击右侧从运行中的程序选择", "Whitelist is empty\r\nDrag a program in, or click on the right to pick from running programs" } },
            { "white.page.pick", new[]{ "选运行中的程序", "Pick a running program" } },
            { "white.page.drop", new[]{ "将 EXE 或快捷方式直接拖入左侧即可添加。\r\n\r\n普通程序会连同其拉起的子进程一并保护，命令行和脚本宿主一类仅保护自身，规则自动判定，无需手动选择。\r\n\r\n需要调整范围请右键条目。", "Drag an EXE or shortcut into the left side to add it.\r\n\r\nRegular programs are protected together with the child processes they spawn; command-line and script hosts protect only themselves. The rule is determined automatically, no manual choice needed.\r\n\r\nRight-click an entry to adjust its scope." } },
            { "white.page.platforms", new[]{ "以下游戏平台的客户端已内置豁免，无需手动添加：{0}", "The following game platform clients are exempted built-in, no manual adding needed: {0}" } },
            { "white.group.auto", new[]{ "自动豁免 {0} 类，按运行环境动态识别", "{0} automatic exemption categories, detected dynamically" } },
            { "white.auto.badge", new[]{ "自动规则", "Automatic" } },
            { "white.auto.state", new[]{ "查看全部", "View all" } },
            { "white.auto.platform", new[]{ "游戏平台与启动器", "Game platforms and launchers" } },
            { "white.auto.platform.sub", new[]{ "Steam、Epic、EA app、Battle.net、WeGame 等按进程身份与安装目录识别；专注档仍可压制纯网页渲染子进程", "Steam, Epic, EA app, Battle.net, WeGame, and others are identified by process identity and install path; Focus mode may still suppress web-only renderer subprocesses" } },
            { "white.auto.platform.detected", new[]{ "本机已检测：{0}；平台主体自动豁免，专注档仍可压制纯网页渲染子进程", "Detected on this PC: {0}; platform cores are exempted automatically, while Focus mode may still suppress web-only renderer subprocesses" } },
            { "white.auto.accel", new[]{ "网游加速器", "Game network accelerators" } },
            { "white.auto.accel.list", new[]{ "明确进程：{0}", "Explicit processes: {0}" } },
            { "white.auto.anticheat", new[]{ "反作弊与游戏保护组件", "Anti-cheat and game protection" } },
            { "white.auto.anticheat.list", new[]{ "已识别：{0}", "Recognized: {0}" } },
            { "white.auto.peripheral", new[]{ "输入、音频与外设驱动链", "Input, audio, and peripheral chains" } },
            { "white.auto.peripheral.list", new[]{ "进程名关键词：{0}", "Process-name keywords: {0}" } },
            { "white.auto.details.body", new[]{ "以下内容直接来自当前版本实际使用的识别目录；点击文本可选择和复制。", "This list is generated directly from the recognition catalogs used by this version. Select the text to copy it." } },
            { "white.auto.details.none", new[]{ "无", "None" } },
            { "white.auto.details.platforms", new[]{ "支持的平台", "Supported platforms" } },
            { "white.auto.details.detected", new[]{ "本机已检测", "Detected on this PC" } },
            { "white.auto.details.platform.note", new[]{ "平台主体按进程身份与安装目录双重校验；专注档仍可压制 steamwebhelper、epicwebhelper、uplaywebcore、blizzardbrowser、riotclientuxrender 这类纯网页渲染子进程。", "Platform cores are verified by both process identity and install path. Focus mode may still suppress web-only renderers such as steamwebhelper, epicwebhelper, uplaywebcore, blizzardbrowser, and riotclientuxrender." } },
            { "white.auto.details.processes", new[]{ "明确进程名（不含 .exe）", "Explicit process names (without .exe)" } },
            { "white.auto.details.tokens", new[]{ "模糊识别关键词（进程名中包含即命中）", "Fuzzy-match tokens (a process-name substring is enough)" } },
            { "white.auto.details.groups", new[]{ "反作弊分组与进程名（不含 .exe）", "Anti-cheat groups and process names (without .exe)" } },
