            { "btn.shader", new[]{ "清理着色器缓存", "Clear shader caches" } },
            { "set.shader.n", new[]{ "驱动更新后出现花屏或卡顿时可清理一次。清理后每个游戏首次启动需重新编译，开头数分钟会更卡。", "Clear once if you see visual corruption or stutter after a driver update. After clearing, each game recompiles shaders on first launch and the first few minutes will stutter more." } },
            { "shader.busy", new[]{ "正在清理", "Cleaning" } },
            { "shader.confirm", new[]{ "清空 NVIDIA、AMD、Intel 和 DirectX 的着色器缓存\r\n\r\n怀疑驱动更新后缓存损坏时可清理一次，不保证清理后即恢复流畅。\r\n\r\n清理前请先退出游戏。之后每个游戏首次启动需重新编译，开头可能更卡。", "Clear the NVIDIA, AMD, Intel and DirectX shader caches\r\n\r\nWorth doing once if you suspect the cache was corrupted by a driver update; no guarantee things run smoothly right after.\r\n\r\nExit your games before cleaning. Afterwards each game recompiles on first launch and may stutter more at the start." } },
            { "shader.freed", new[]{ "已清理着色器缓存，释放 {0}", "Shader caches cleared, freed {0}" } },
            { "shader.ingame", new[]{ "检测到游戏正在运行。驱动此刻正在读写着色器缓存，现在清理会立刻造成对局内卡顿，请退出游戏后再清理。", "A game is currently running. The driver is actively reading and writing the shader caches; cleaning now would cause in-game stutter immediately. Exit the game first." } },
