            { "os.old.body", new[]{ "本机 Windows 内部版本为 {0}，低于 Pavise 的建议最低版本。\r\n\r\n建议最低版本：Windows 10 2004（内部版本 {1}）\r\n最佳版本：Windows 11 24H2（内部版本 {2}）\r\n\r\n低于建议最低版本时，以下能力由系统提供而本机没有：显卡进程优先级提升、硬件加速 GPU 调度、逐进程计时器分辨率。相关开关会自动置灰，其余功能照常可用。\r\n\r\n本提示每个系统版本只出现一次。", "This machine's Windows build is {0}, below the minimum version recommended for Pavise.\r\n\r\nRecommended minimum: Windows 10 2004 (build {1})\r\nBest: Windows 11 24H2 (build {2})\r\n\r\nBelow the recommended minimum, the following capabilities are provided by the OS and are absent here: GPU process priority boost, hardware-accelerated GPU scheduling, and per-process timer resolution. The related switches are greyed out automatically; everything else works as usual.\r\n\r\nThis notice appears only once per OS version." } },
