            { "set.fpsoverlay", new[]{ "游戏内帧率小窗", "In-game frame rate overlay" } },
            { "set.fpsoverlay.n", new[]{ "以一条细横条显示帧率、帧时间、整机与游戏进程的 CPU 占用、GPU 占用、显存与 GPU 温度，默认紧贴屏幕顶部中间。取不到的项直接不显示，不会拿零来充数。该窗口可被点击穿透，不会挡住任何操作。数据取自系统的呈现事件，不注入游戏进程、不读取游戏内存、不打开游戏进程句柄。需要注意：任何浮在游戏画面上方的窗口都会让游戏退出独立翻转合成，可能增加约一帧的显示延迟；独占全屏的游戏不会显示该窗口。默认关闭，追求最低延迟时请保持关闭。", "Shows frame rate, frame time, whole-machine and game-process CPU load, GPU load, video memory, and GPU temperature in a thin horizontal bar, by default hugging the top center of the screen. Anything that cannot be read is simply left out rather than shown as zero. The window is click-through and never blocks input. The data comes from system present events — no injection into the game, no reading of game memory, and no handle opened on the game process. Note that any window floating above the game makes it leave independent flip composition, which may add roughly one frame of display latency, and games in exclusive fullscreen will not show it. Off by default; keep it off when chasing the lowest possible latency." } },
