            { "t.versionmigrations.8", new[]{ "网卡中断亲和", "NIC interrupt affinity" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.9", new[]{ "无实测数据", "No measured data" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.10", new[]{ "Nagle 与延迟 ACK", "Nagle and delayed ACK" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.11", new[]{ "现代游戏的实时流量走 UDP，与 Nagle 算法无关", "Real-time traffic in modern games uses UDP, which Nagle does not affect" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.12", new[]{ "禁用全屏优化", "Disable fullscreen optimizations" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.13", new[]{ "禁用后将失去自动 HDR 与可变刷新率", "Disabling it forfeits Auto HDR and variable refresh rate" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.14", new[]{ "硬盘中断避让", "Disk interrupt avoidance" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.15", new[]{ "仅测得 DPC 次数下降，无帧率数据支撑", "Only a reduction in DPC counts was measured; there is no frame-rate data to support it" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.16", new[]{ "禁用 MPO", "Disable MPO" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.17", new[]{ "仅极少数驱动与显示器组合需要该项。禁用后画面全部改走合成路径，并影响抓屏类程序", "Only a very small number of driver and monitor combinations require it. Disabling routes all output through composition and affects screen-capture programs" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.18", new[]{ "后台迁移至集显", "Push background apps to the iGPU" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.19", new[]{ "将后台程序的显卡偏好持久写为集显，导致驱动录屏与视频类程序受到误伤，且对已运行的进程无法生效", "It persistently wrote background programs' GPU preference to the integrated GPU, which affected driver recording and video programs as collateral damage and could not apply to already-running processes" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.20", new[]{ "视觉效果降级", "Visual effects downgrade" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.21", new[]{ "全屏游戏时桌面本就不参与合成，关闭透明与动画对帧率无可测收益，却修改了用户的系统设置", "The desktop is not composited during fullscreen games, so disabling transparency and animations yields no measurable frame-rate gain while still changing the user's system settings" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.22", new[]{ "后台硬限帧", "Background hard frame cap" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.23", new[]{ "该项写入的是 NVIDIA 基础 Profile 的全局条目，限制的是失去焦点的程序：玩家切出游戏时，游戏本身即被限制到 20 帧，双屏与挂机场景受影响最大", "It wrote a global entry in the NVIDIA base profile that capped whichever program lost focus: the moment the player tabbed out, the game itself was capped to 20 fps, with dual-monitor and idle scenarios affected most" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.24", new[]{ "Pavise 托管电源计划", "Pavise managed power plan" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.25", new[]{ "自建电源计划并逐项写入，等同于代替用户修改系统设置，且与显卡驱动、厂商工具的电源策略相互冲突。现已改为仅切换、不改写", "Creating its own plan and writing every parameter amounted to changing system settings on the user's behalf, and it conflicted with the power policies of GPU drivers and vendor tools. It now only switches plans and never rewrites them" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.26", new[]{ "对局稳定后回收后台工作集", "Reclaim background working sets after the match stabilizes" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.27", new[]{ "SetProcessWorkingSetSize 并不释放内存，只是将页面移入待机列表，脏页还需先写盘，而这部分 IO 恰好落在对局期间。被压制的后台本就是内存管理器在压力下首批自然裁剪的对象；进程未挂起，裁剪后立即缺页读回，数秒后即失去意义", "SetProcessWorkingSetSize does not free memory; it only moves pages to the standby list, and dirty pages must be written to disk first, with that I/O landing in the middle of the match. Suppressed background processes are already the first thing the memory manager trims under pressure, and since they are not suspended, the pages fault straight back in, making the work pointless within seconds" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.28", new[]{ "待机列表超阈值时清空", "Purge the standby list when it exceeds a threshold" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.29", new[]{ "触发条件成立时清空仅换回 382MB 可用内存，代价是 1380 毫秒的全系统阻塞与整个文件缓存被丢弃；且检查周期为 5 秒且无冷却，在低配机器上会形成清空、读盘、再堆积的反复触发，比其试图解决的微卡顿更严重", "When the trigger condition was met, the purge recovered only 382MB of available memory at the cost of a 1380 ms system-wide stall and the loss of the entire file cache. With a 5-second check interval and no cooldown, low-spec machines fell into a repeating cycle of purge, disk read, and rebuild that was worse than the micro-stutter it was meant to solve" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.30", new[]{ "游戏时免打扰", "Do not disturb while gaming" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.31", new[]{ "该项仅修改 ToastEnabled 一个开关。微信、QQ 的弹窗为自绘窗口，无法拦截；全屏独占时系统横幅本就不抢焦点。实测无收益", "It changed only the single ToastEnabled switch. WeChat and QQ popups are self-drawn windows that it cannot block, and in exclusive fullscreen system banners do not steal focus anyway. No gain was measured" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.32", new[]{ "刷新率属于持久设置，在多数机器上每局空转；中途被系统改回也无法察觉。现改由系统体检页作只读提示", "Refresh rate is a persistent setting that idled every match on most machines, and a mid-match revert by the system could not be detected. It is now surfaced as a read-only note on the System Checkup page" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.33", new[]{ "被引流的诊断、更新、打印类服务本就几乎不占用 CPU，调整其核心归属收益接近于零；真正的游戏核心隔离已由后台压制系统覆盖", "The diagnostic, update, and print services it rerouted barely use any CPU, so moving them between cores gains almost nothing, while real game-core isolation is already covered by the background suppression system" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.34", new[]{ "电源滑块最佳性能", "Power slider Best Performance" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.35", new[]{ "在散热受限的笔记本上，将滑块拉满会更早触及温度墙，持续性能反而下降；在台式机上则与高性能电源计划重复", "On thermally limited laptops, maxing the slider reaches the thermal limit sooner and sustained performance drops; on desktops it duplicates the high-performance power plan" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.36", new[]{ "暂停搜索索引与预读服务", "Pause search indexing and prefetch services" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.37", new[]{ "固态硬盘上测不出差异，机械硬盘用户占比极低，而停止与恢复服务本身需要数秒，收益无法覆盖成本", "No measurable difference on SSDs, the HDD user base is very small, and stopping and restarting the services itself takes seconds, so the gain does not cover the cost" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.38", new[]{ "对局中调用 PowerShell 刷新 NetQos 组策略不稳定，存在明显的顿挫风险；思路成立但实现不可靠", "Invoking PowerShell mid-match to refresh NetQos group policy is unstable and carries a clear risk of hitching; the concept holds but the implementation is unreliable" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.39", new[]{ "NVIDIA 驱动级帧率上限", "NVIDIA driver-level frame rate cap" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.40", new[]{ "AMD 驱动级帧率上限", "AMD driver-level frame rate cap" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.41", new[]{ "限帧交由游戏内设置或显卡控制面板更直接，驱动层重复限制易与游戏自身限帧及 VRR 冲突。已下架并还原驱动原值", "Frame capping is more direct in the game's own settings or the GPU control panel, and a second cap at the driver layer easily conflicts with the game's own limiter and VRR. Removed, and the original driver values restored" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.42", new[]{ "USB 控制器中断亲和", "USB controller interrupt affinity" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.43", new[]{ "将 USB 中断绑定到固定核心后，在性能核数量较少的混合架构上会落到低频能效核，造成高回报率鼠标空闲后首次点击延迟。收益不确定而风险明确，已下架并将设备中断策略还原为系统默认", "Pinning USB interrupts to fixed cores placed them on low-clock efficiency cores on hybrid processors with few performance cores, causing a delay on the first click after idle with high polling-rate mice. The benefit was uncertain and the risk clear, so it was removed and device interrupt policy restored to the system default" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.45", new[]{ "该项在 1.8.1.1 曾整项下架，现改回优化策略页上的可选开关，默认关闭，开启前先弹窗说明代价。下架的理由仍然成立：微软的平衡、高性能、卓越性能三套方案该项取值均为 0，全核常驻 C0 只增功耗与发热；但确有机型能从中拿到更稳的帧时间，值不值得由用户自己实测。因此升级时统一重置为关闭，需要的请自行开启", "This option was removed outright in 1.8.1.1 and is back as an opt-in switch on the Optimization Policy page, off by default, with a dialog explaining the cost before it can be enabled. The reason for removing it still holds: Microsoft's Balanced, High performance, and Ultimate Performance plans all leave it at 0, and keeping every core at C0 only adds power draw and heat. Some machines do get steadier frame times from it, though, so whether it is worth it is for you to measure. It is therefore reset to off on upgrade; turn it back on if you want it" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.46", new[]{ "该开关只作用于显卡一台设备，且仅在混合架构上真正写入掩码，同构处理器上退化为由系统就近处理。设备中断页会列出本机所有可修改中断亲和性的设备，显卡只是其中之一，由用户自行选择。开关已下架，其写入的注册表值在此处还原", "This switch covered the GPU alone and only wrote a real mask on hybrid processors, degrading to system-managed nearby placement on uniform processors. The Device Interrupts page lists every device on this machine whose interrupt affinity can be changed, with the GPU as just one of them, and leaves the choice to the user. The switch has been removed, and the registry values it wrote are restored here" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.47", new[]{ "前台时间片的三档选择下架。原来的系统默认档写死 0x02、前台加权档写死 0x26，但按 Windows Internals 的 PspForegroundQuantum 表解码，这两个值在内核里得到的调度行为完全相同（短、可变、前台后台 18:6），分档是一个不存在的差别；且该项对输入延迟没有任何对照实测。现在只保留体检里的判据：微软只对最低两位有官方文档，低于文档最大档才报，修复也只改这两位。原档位写入的值随升级还原", "The three-way picker for the foreground time slice has been retired. The old System default option wrote a hard-coded 0x02 and the Foreground weighted option wrote a hard-coded 0x26, but decoded against the PspForegroundQuantum table in Windows Internals both values produce exactly the same scheduling behaviour in the kernel (short, variable, 18:6 foreground to background) — the two options were a distinction that does not exist, and the setting has no controlled measurement behind it for input latency. What remains is the checkup judgment alone: Microsoft documents only the lowest two bits, a value below the documented maximum is reported, and the fix touches only those two bits. Values written by the retired options are restored on upgrade" } },
            { "t.versionmigrations.44", new[]{ "按 exe 写入注册表且下次启动才生效，属于持久改动，却混在对局链路中以会话功能的形式呈现；现代 Windows 本就默认为游戏选择独立显卡。已下架并还原写入过的偏好", "It wrote per-exe registry entries that only took effect on the next launch — a persistent change presented as a session feature inside the match pipeline — while modern Windows already selects the discrete GPU for games by default. Removed, and the preferences it wrote restored" } },
