            { "t.systemaudithardware.1", new[]{ "内存频率", "Memory frequency" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.2", new[]{ " 标称 ", " rated " } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.3", new[]{ "读取失败", "Read failed" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.4", new[]{ "疑似运行在 JEDEC 默认频率，未达到内存条的标称速度。可在 BIOS 中启用 XMP 或 EXPO，台架实测 1% 最差帧可提升一成以上。板载内存机型不适用该判断。", "Likely running at the JEDEC default frequency rather than the rated speed of the modules. Enable XMP or EXPO in the BIOS; bench-verified 1% low gains exceed 10%. This check does not apply to machines with onboard memory." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.5", new[]{ "已接近标称频率，或本机读数不足以判断，无需处理。", "Close to the rated frequency, or the local readings are insufficient to judge; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.6", new[]{ "内存通道", "Memory channels" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.7", new[]{ " 条内存", " memory module(s)" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.8", new[]{ "单条内存仅有单通道带宽，对 1% 最差帧影响明显。加装一条同规格内存组成双通道，是性价比最高的升级之一。板载内存机型不适用。", "A single module provides only single-channel bandwidth, which noticeably affects the 1% low. Adding a matching module for dual-channel is one of the most cost-effective upgrades. Not applicable to machines with soldered memory." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.9", new[]{ "两条及以上，通常已组成双通道，无需处理。", "Two or more modules, normally already running dual-channel; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.10", new[]{ "多屏刷新率", "Multi-monitor refresh rates" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.11", new[]{ "多台显示器刷新率不一致，该系统版本的桌面合成器会因此掉帧，副屏播放视频时主屏表现最明显。24H2 已改进，建议更新系统，或将副屏设为相同刷新率。", "The monitors run at mismatched refresh rates, and the desktop compositor on this Windows version drops frames as a result, most visibly on the primary display while the secondary plays video. 24H2 improved this: update Windows, or set the secondary display to the same refresh rate." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.12", new[]{ "刷新率不一致，但当前系统版本已包含混合刷新率改进，一般无影响。", "The refresh rates differ, but this Windows version already includes the mixed-refresh-rate improvements, so there is generally no impact." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.13", new[]{ "各显示器一致，无需处理。", "All displays match; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.14", new[]{ "CPU 降频事件", "CPU throttling events" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.15", new[]{ "近 7 天 ", "Last 7 days " } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.16", new[]{ "近 7 天无记录", "No records in the last 7 days" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.17", new[]{ "系统日志中存在内核处理器降频记录，多为散热或供电不足所致，是长时间游戏后卡顿加剧的常见真实原因。建议清理灰尘、改善风道或检查电源适配器后再复查本项。", "The system log contains kernel processor throttling records, usually caused by inadequate cooling or power delivery — a common real cause of games getting choppier over a long session. Clean out dust, improve airflow, or check the power adapter, then re-run this check." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.18", new[]{ "系统日志中无处理器降频记录，散热与供电当前不构成瓶颈。", "The system log contains no processor throttling records; cooling and power delivery are not a bottleneck at present." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.19", new[]{ "灯效常驻软件", "Resident RGB lighting software" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.21", new[]{ "Ryzen 分支预测优化", "Ryzen branch prediction optimization" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.22", new[]{ "系统版本较旧", "Windows version is old" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.23", new[]{ "24H2 已含", "Included in 24H2" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.24", new[]{ "Windows 11 24H2 为 Ryzen 加入分支预测优化，台架实测游戏平均提升约一成，个别标题更高。23H2 安装 2024 年 8 月之后的累积更新亦已回移该优化。建议更新系统。", "Windows 11 24H2 adds branch prediction optimizations for Ryzen, bench-verified at roughly 10% faster on average in games and more in some titles. 23H2 with cumulative updates released after August 2024 has it backported as well. Updating Windows is recommended." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.25", new[]{ "当前系统已包含 AMD 分支预测优化，无需处理。", "This Windows version already includes the AMD branch prediction optimizations; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.26", new[]{ "旧 DX10、DX11 游戏的窗口化呈现已走升级路径，保持当前状态即可。", "Windowed presentation for old DX10 and DX11 games already uses the upgraded path; leave it as it is." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.27", new[]{ "微软官方背书的降延迟机制：旧 DX10、DX11 游戏窗口化时改走翻转呈现模型，同时解锁自动 HDR 与可变刷新率。处理方式：在系统环境页开启「窗口化游戏优化」，重启游戏后生效。", "A latency-reduction mechanism officially backed by Microsoft: old DX10 and DX11 games switch to the flip presentation model when windowed, which also unlocks Auto HDR and variable refresh rate. How to fix: enable Optimizations for windowed games on the System Environment page; effective after restarting the game." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.28", new[]{ "显卡 MSI 中断", "GPU MSI interrupts" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.29", new[]{ " 个设备被关闭", " device(s) disabled" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.31", new[]{ "MSISupported 被显式写为 0，可能是旧优化工具残留，也可能是为规避该显卡开启 MSI 后的黑屏或死机而有意关闭。中断退回传统线模式会抬高 DPC 延迟。若本机未因 MSI 出现过故障，可点击右侧修复写回，重启后生效，可还原。", "MSISupported is explicitly set to 0. This may be residue from an old optimization tool, or a deliberate change to work around black screens or hangs this GPU showed with MSI enabled. Falling back to legacy line-based interrupts raises DPC latency. If this machine has never had MSI-related faults, use the fix on the right to write it back; effective after a reboot and restorable." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.32", new[]{ "消息信号中断未被干预，现代驱动默认即为 MSI，无需处理。", "Message-signaled interrupts have not been tampered with; modern drivers use MSI by default. No action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.33", new[]{ "3D V-Cache 优化驱动", "3D V-Cache optimizer driver" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.34", new[]{ "已安装，游戏模式开启", "Installed, Game Mode on" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.35", new[]{ "已安装，游戏模式关闭", "Installed, Game Mode off" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.36", new[]{ "未安装", "Not installed" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.37", new[]{ "AMD 优化驱动服务在位，由它判定游戏该用哪一块 CCD。核心策略保持默认全核即可，无需 Pavise 代劳。", "The AMD optimizer driver service is present and decides which CCD a game should use. Keeping the core strategy on the default of all cores is fine; Pavise does not need to step in." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.38", new[]{ "AMD 优化驱动服务在位，但系统游戏模式是关的。该驱动依赖系统侧的游戏识别来知道哪个进程是游戏，关掉游戏模式后它可能收不到信号。若怀疑游戏没跑在大缓存 CCD 上，可先打开游戏模式再观察，仍不对再到策略页手动选单 CCD。", "The AMD optimizer driver service is present, but Windows Game Mode is off. The driver relies on the system-side game detection to learn which process is a game, and may receive no signal while Game Mode is off. If you suspect a game is not running on the large-cache CCD, turn Game Mode on and observe first; if it is still wrong, pick a single CCD manually on the strategy page." } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.39", new[]{ "本机是非对称缓存机型但没装 AMD 3D V-Cache 优化驱动，CCD 选择完全交给 Windows 默认调度。装上官方芯片组驱动通常比手动指定核心更稳妥；不想装则可在策略页手动选单 CCD，切换后请自己观察 1% 最差帧。", "This is an asymmetric-cache part but the AMD 3D V-Cache optimizer driver is not installed, so CCD selection is left entirely to the Windows default scheduler. Installing the official chipset driver is usually safer than pinning cores by hand; if you would rather not, pick a single CCD manually on the strategy page and watch the 1% low yourself after switching." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.1", new[]{ "主屏刷新率", "Primary display refresh rate" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.2", new[]{ "强烈建议处理", "Strongly recommend fixing" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.3", new[]{ "当前 ", "Current " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.4", new[]{ "Hz 可用 ", "Hz, available " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.5", new[]{ "Hz。该项的收益比本页任何调度优化都更直接，帧率上限差距可达成倍，且无任何代价。处理方式：在系统设置 - 显示 - 高级显示中将刷新率改为 ", "Hz. This item pays off more directly than any scheduling optimization on this page: the gap in frame-rate ceiling can be twofold, at no cost. How to fix: in Windows Settings - Display - Advanced display, set the refresh rate to " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.6", new[]{ "Hz。该项为持久设置，修改一次后长期生效，Pavise 不代为修改。", "Hz. This is a persistent setting: change it once and it stays. Pavise does not change it for you." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.7", new[]{ "筛选键", "Filter Keys" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.8", new[]{ "筛选键已在输入路径上插入 ", "Filter Keys is inserting " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.9", new[]{ " 毫秒的接受延迟。键鼠链路的外设段总计仅 1 至 5 毫秒，该项单项即为其数倍。多数情况是游戏中长按 Shift 触发提示框误开启。处理方式：在系统环境页开启「辅助功能按键拦截」，无需管理员权限，无需重启。", " ms of acceptance delay into the input path. The peripheral segment of the keyboard/mouse chain totals only 1 to 5 ms, so this single item is several times that. It is usually enabled by accident through the prompt raised by holding Shift in a game. How to fix: enable Accessibility key interception on the System Environment page. No administrator rights or reboot needed." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.10", new[]{ "辅助功能热键", "Accessibility hotkeys" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.11", new[]{ "建议关闭", "Recommend disabling" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.12", new[]{ "当前未吞掉击键，但生效位或触发热键仍存在：连按五次 Shift 或长按右 Shift 八秒会在全屏游戏中弹出提示框，一次打断对局的代价高于任何毫秒级优化的收益。处理方式：在系统环境页开启「辅助功能按键拦截」。", "It is not swallowing keystrokes at present, but the active bits or trigger hotkeys remain: pressing Shift five times, or holding right Shift for eight seconds, raises a dialog over a fullscreen game, and one interrupted match costs more than any millisecond-level optimization gains. How to fix: enable Accessibility key interception on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.13", new[]{ "蓝牙键鼠", "Bluetooth keyboard/mouse" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.14", new[]{ "建议换连接方式", "Recommend switching connection type" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.15", new[]{ "台架实测同一只鼠标：蓝牙约 10.4 毫秒，2.4G 接收器约 3.6 毫秒，2.4G 与有线基本无差异。「无线慢于有线」的说法已过时，但蓝牙确实存在明显差距，这 7 毫秒超过本页全部软件优化的总和。处理方式：改用 2.4G 接收器或有线连接，该项无软件解法。", "Bench-verified with the same mouse: about 10.4 ms over Bluetooth versus about 3.6 ms on a 2.4G receiver, while 2.4G is essentially identical to wired. The claim that wireless is slower than wired is outdated, but Bluetooth genuinely lags, and those 7 ms outweigh every software optimization on this page combined. How to fix: use a 2.4G receiver or a wired connection. There is no software fix." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.16", new[]{ "本项针对空闲一段时间后首次操作的停顿，不改善稳态延迟。台式机无代价，可直接关闭；笔记本需权衡续航。处理方式：在系统环境页开启「禁止键鼠设备选择性暂停」。", "This addresses the pause on the first input after a period of idleness, not steady-state latency. There is no cost on a desktop, so it can simply be disabled; on laptops, weigh it against battery life. How to fix: enable Block selective suspend for keyboard and mouse on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.17", new[]{ "键鼠队列长度", "Keyboard/mouse queue length" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.18", new[]{ "建议改回默认", "Recommend reverting to default" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.19", new[]{ "该值已被第三方工具修改。它决定可缓存的输入条数，不决定输入的处理速度，因此调整不会降低延迟；调低后高回报率鼠标可能丢失输入。点击右侧一键修复改回默认值 100，重启后生效，可还原。", "This value has been changed by a third-party tool. It determines how many input events can be buffered, not how fast input is processed, so changing it does not reduce latency; lowering it can drop inputs on high polling-rate mice. Use the one-click fix on the right to restore the default of 100; effective after a reboot and restorable." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.20", new[]{ "输入延迟的主要构成", "Where input latency actually comes from" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.21", new[]{ "调整前请先了解", "Understand this before tweaking" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.22", new[]{ "端到端延迟分三段：外设 1 至 5 毫秒；渲染管线在 GPU 满载时 20 至 60 毫秒；显示器 3 至 20 毫秒。因此键鼠注册表偏方作用于错误的量级，真正的主要来源是渲染队列堆积。处理方式：游戏支持 NVIDIA Reflex 或 AMD Anti-Lag 时在游戏内开启；否则将帧率上限压至 GPU 占用 90 至 95%，避免长期贴着刷新率上限运行——那会隐式触发垂直同步，反而增加半帧至一帧。显卡页的帧率上限与低延迟选项即用于此。", "End-to-end latency has three segments: peripherals 1 to 5 ms, the render pipeline 20 to 60 ms when the GPU is saturated, and the display 3 to 20 ms. Keyboard and mouse registry tweaks therefore act at the wrong order of magnitude; the dominant source is render queue buildup. How to fix: enable NVIDIA Reflex or AMD Anti-Lag in-game where supported; otherwise cap the frame rate so GPU usage sits at 90 to 95%, and avoid running pinned to the refresh-rate ceiling, which implicitly triggers vsync and adds half a frame to a full frame instead. The frame rate cap and low latency options on the Graphics page serve exactly this purpose." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.23", new[]{ "已开启，无需处理。", "Already enabled; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.24", new[]{ "建议开启", "Recommend enabling" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.25", new[]{ "合成台架六轮配对实测：1% 最差帧改善中位数 90.7%，且不随运行时间累积恶化。", "Six rounds of paired testing on the synthetic bench: median improvement of 90.7% in the 1% low, with no degradation accumulating over runtime." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.26", new[]{ "Windows 游戏模式", "Windows Game Mode" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.27", new[]{ "系统原生的游戏时段后台抑制，无兼容性风险。", "The native background suppression Windows applies while gaming; no compatibility risk." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.28", new[]{ "NVIDIA 深度调优", "NVIDIA deep tuning" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.29", new[]{ "可以尝试", "Worth trying" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.30", new[]{ "本机不适用", "Not applicable on this machine" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.31", new[]{ "在显卡页按游戏开启。连续写入失败时将自动关闭对应开关。", "Enable it per game on the Graphics page. Consecutive write failures automatically disable the corresponding switch." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.32", new[]{ "核显没有对应的调优接口，本项跳过。收益来自后台压制、核心绑定与电源计划。", "Integrated graphics has no corresponding tuning interface, so this item is skipped. The gains come from background suppression, core binding, and the power plan." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.33", new[]{ "没有 NVIDIA 驱动接口", "No NVIDIA driver interface" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.43", new[]{ "Game DVR 后台录制", "Game DVR background recording" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.44", new[]{ "后台录制在开启期间持续产生开销，而多数用户并不使用 Xbox Game Bar 的录制功能。", "Background recording incurs overhead the entire time it is on, and most users never use the Xbox Game Bar recording feature." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.45", new[]{ "内存余量", "Memory headroom" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.46", new[]{ "只剩 ", "Only " } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.47", new[]{ " GB 可用。内存不足时系统会以硬盘作为内存的后备，产生毫秒级等待，比任何调度问题都更容易造成明显卡顿。处理方式：关闭占用内存较高的后台程序；长期紧张则应加装内存，该项无软件解法。", " GB free. Under memory pressure the system falls back to disk as memory, producing millisecond-scale waits that cause visible stutter more readily than any scheduling issue. How to fix: close memory-heavy background programs; if it stays tight, add memory. There is no software fix." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.48", new[]{ "可以尝试关闭", "Worth trying to disable" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.49", new[]{ "存在代价：影响内存完整性、WSL2、Docker 与 Windows 沙盒，使用这些功能时不应关闭。处理方式：在系统环境页找到 VBS 卡片并开启开关，重启后生效。", "There is a cost: it affects Memory Integrity, WSL2, Docker, and Windows Sandbox, so do not disable it if you use those. How to fix: find the VBS card on the System Environment page and flip the switch; effective after a reboot." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.50", new[]{ "平台时钟", "Platform timer" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.51", new[]{ "建议校正", "Recommend correcting" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.52", new[]{ "强制 HPET 是十余年前教程的遗留做法，TSC 计时比其快数个数量级。点击右侧一键修复即可清除，重启后生效，可还原。", "Forcing HPET is a leftover from decade-old guides; TSC timing is orders of magnitude faster. Use the one-click fix on the right to clear it; effective after a reboot and restorable." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.53", new[]{ "页面文件", "Page file" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.54", new[]{ "建议恢复", "Recommend restoring" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.55", new[]{ "关闭页面文件不会提升帧率，只会把内存不足时的降速变为直接崩溃，部分游戏与反作弊还要求其存在。", "Disabling the page file does not raise the frame rate; it only turns slowdown under memory pressure into outright crashes, and some games and anti-cheat systems require it to exist." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.56", new[]{ "可用托管方案解除", "Use the managed plan to lift it" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.57", new[]{ "当前电源方案在低负载时会让部分 CPU 核心进入停泊状态，从停泊态唤醒存在额外延迟，表现为偶发停顿与 1% 最差帧变差。在优化策略页启用 Pavise 托管电源方案，可使对局全程保持全部核心唤醒；也可在 Windows 电源选项中调高处理器最小状态手动解除。", "The current power plan parks some CPU cores at low load, and waking from the parked state adds latency, showing up as occasional pauses and a worse 1% low. Enabling the Pavise managed power plan on the Optimization Policy page keeps all cores awake for the whole match; alternatively, raise the processor minimum state in Windows power options to lift parking manually." } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.58", new[]{ "与核心分区叠加", "Compounds with core partitioning" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.59", new[]{ "　核心分区同时处于开启状态：游戏被限定在少数核心上，这些核心一旦停泊，游戏无其他核心可用，只能等待唤醒；未分区时调度器还可临时改用其他已唤醒的核心。因此两项同时开启比任一单独开启更易出现帧时间毛刺。Pavise 不会修改用户自行选定的电源方案，是否解除停泊由用户决定。", " Core partitioning is also enabled: the game is confined to a small set of cores, and once those park it has no other core to run on and must wait for them to wake, whereas without partitioning the scheduler could switch to another awake core. The two together are therefore more prone to frame-time spikes than either alone. Pavise does not modify a power plan you selected yourself; whether to lift parking is your decision." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.3", new[]{ "本机仅有核显，显卡页的驱动深度调优不适用；后台压制、核心绑定与电源计划照常生效，帧率收益主要来自这些项。", "This machine has integrated graphics only, so the deep driver tuning on the Graphics page does not apply. Background suppression, core binding, and the power plan still work, and the frame-rate gains come from those." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.4", new[]{ "已检测到独立显卡。显卡页的驱动项是否可用，取决于下方两项接口检测结果。", "A discrete GPU is present. Whether the driver items on the Graphics page are usable depends on the two interface checks below." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.5", new[]{ "NVIDIA 驱动接口", "NVIDIA driver interface" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.6", new[]{ "可用", "Available" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.7", new[]{ "不可用", "Unavailable" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.8", new[]{ "电源模式、帧率上限、预渲染帧数等驱动项在本机可用。写入失败时将自动停用对应开关。", "Driver items such as power mode, frame rate cap, and pre-rendered frames are available on this machine. A write failure automatically disables the corresponding switch." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.9", new[]{ "检测到 NVIDIA 显卡，但驱动接口无法初始化，通常是驱动版本过低或安装的是精简版驱动。显卡页 NVIDIA 区整体停用。", "An NVIDIA GPU is present but the driver interface cannot be initialized, usually because the driver is too old or a stripped-down build is installed. The NVIDIA section of the Graphics page is disabled." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.10", new[]{ "本机没有 NVIDIA 显卡，显卡页 NVIDIA 区整体停用。", "No NVIDIA GPU is present; the NVIDIA section of the Graphics page is disabled." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.11", new[]{ "AMD 显卡", "AMD GPU" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.12", new[]{ "已识别", "Detected" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.13", new[]{ "未检测到", "Not detected" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.14", new[]{ "驱动专项调优仅覆盖 NVIDIA。AMD 显卡的收益来自后台压制、核心绑定与电源计划等通用优化。", "Dedicated driver tuning covers NVIDIA only. AMD GPUs gain from the general optimizations: background suppression, core binding, and the power plan." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.15", new[]{ "本机没有 AMD 显卡", "No AMD GPU on this machine" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.16", new[]{ "CPU Sets 分区", "CPU Sets partitioning" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.17", new[]{ "可将后台进程限定到独立核心，为游戏保留其余核心。", "Can confine background processes to separate cores, reserving the remaining cores for the game." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.18", new[]{ "核心数量不足以划分分区，压制仅降低优先级。实测表明该步骤已占绝大部分收益。", "There are too few cores to partition, so suppression only lowers priorities. Measurements show that step alone accounts for most of the gain." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.19", new[]{ "效率模式 EcoQoS", "Efficiency mode (EcoQoS)" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.20", new[]{ "不支持", "Not supported" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.21", new[]{ "支持", "Supported" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.22", new[]{ "接口可用", "Interface available" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.23", new[]{ "本机无法查询该状态，温和档将跳过该手段。", "This state cannot be queried on this machine, so the Gentle tier skips this technique." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.24", new[]{ "温和档可使系统对后台进程降频，并将其迁移至能效核心。", "The Gentle tier lets the system down-clock background processes and move them to efficiency cores." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.25", new[]{ "Windows 10 同样可以压制，但彻底程度低于 Windows 11，效果依然存在。", "Suppression also works on Windows 10, though less thoroughly than on Windows 11; the effect remains." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.26", new[]{ "操作系统", "Operating system" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.27", new[]{ "系统版本决定可用的优化手段，同一开关在不同版本上的实际行为并不相同。", "The Windows version determines which techniques are available; the same switch behaves differently across versions." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.1", new[]{ "未被修改", "Unmodified" } },
            { "t.systemaudithardware.30", new[]{ "正常", "Normal" } },
            { "t.systemauditverdicts.35", new[]{ "建议处理", "Recommend fixing" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.28", new[]{ "混合架构（P 核 + E 核）。默认全核，可手动切换为仅性能核。", "Hybrid architecture (P-cores plus E-cores). All cores by default; can be switched manually to performance cores only." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.29", new[]{ "非对称缓存（X3D）。默认全核，可手动切换至大缓存 CCD。", "Asymmetric cache (X3D). All cores by default; can be switched manually to the large-cache CCD." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.30", new[]{ "对称多 CCD。默认全核，可手动切换至单个完整 CCD。", "Symmetric multi-CCD. All cores by default; can be switched manually to one full CCD." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.31", new[]{ "同构架构。默认全核，可手动切换至游戏核心分区。", "Homogeneous architecture. All cores by default; can be switched manually to a game core partition." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.32", new[]{ "同构", "Homogeneous" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.33", new[]{ "CPU 拓扑", "CPU topology" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.34", new[]{ " 物理核 ", " physical cores, " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.35", new[]{ " 线程", " threads" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.36", new[]{ " 手动游戏分区 0x", " manual game partition 0x" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.37", new[]{ " 本机不划分后台核心", " background cores not partitioned on this machine" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.38", new[]{ "整机 CPU 占用", "Total CPU usage" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.39", new[]{ "体检窗口 ", "Checkup window " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.40", new[]{ " 秒", " s" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.41", new[]{ " 毫秒", " ms" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.42", new[]{ " 内的平均占用", " — average usage within this window" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.54", new[]{ " 已是最高", " is already the highest" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.55", new[]{ " 可用 ", " available " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.56", new[]{ "无法读取显示模式，远程桌面与部分虚拟显示器上会出现该情况，本次不对该项作出判断。", "The display mode could not be read; this occurs over Remote Desktop and on some virtual displays. This item is not evaluated this time." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.57", new[]{ "当前分辨率下没有更高的刷新率可选", "No higher refresh rate is available at the current resolution" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.58", new[]{ "当前刷新率 ", "Current refresh rate " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.59", new[]{ "Hz，该显示器在相同分辨率下支持 ", "Hz; at the same resolution this display supports " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.60", new[]{ "Hz，二者的差值是直接的帧率损失。处理方式：在系统设置 - 显示 - 高级显示中将刷新率改为 ", "Hz. The difference is a direct frame-rate loss. How to fix: in Windows Settings - Display - Advanced display, set the refresh rate to " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.61", new[]{ "Hz。该项为持久设置，修改一次后长期生效。", "Hz. This is a persistent setting: change it once and it stays." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.62", new[]{ "NVIDIA 降频状态", "NVIDIA throttling status" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.63", new[]{ "显卡当前受上述原因限制。若游戏中长期如此，瓶颈在散热或供电，而非调度。", "The GPU is currently limited by the reasons above. If this persists in game, the bottleneck is cooling or power delivery, not scheduling." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.64", new[]{ "当前无降频。若游戏中出现限制，每局结束时会记入运行日志。", "No throttling at present. If limits occur during a match, they are written to the run log when the match ends." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.65", new[]{ "节能模式", "Energy saver mode" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.66", new[]{ "开着", "On" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.67", new[]{ "关着", "Off" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.68", new[]{ "系统处于节能模式：亮度受限、后台活动被拦截，电源模式同时被锁定，Pavise 的电源优化无法生效。请在系统设置中关闭后再进行游戏。", "The system is in Energy Saver mode: brightness is limited, background activity is blocked, and the power mode is locked, so the power optimizations in Pavise cannot take effect. Turn it off in Windows Settings before gaming." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.69", new[]{ "未拦截电源优化", "Not blocking power optimizations" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.70", new[]{ "生效中", "Active" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.71", new[]{ "长时间无键鼠输入时，前台程序不会被降级。", "The foreground app is not demoted after a long stretch without keyboard or mouse input." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.72", new[]{ "系统默认在长时间无键鼠输入后降低前台程序的服务质量，手柄游戏、过场动画与挂机场景普遍受影响。可在优化策略页关闭该行为。", "By default the system lowers the foreground app quality of service after a long stretch without keyboard or mouse input; controller games, cutscenes, and idle scenarios are commonly affected. This behavior can be disabled on the Optimization Policy page." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.73", new[]{ "ReBAR 显存直通", "ReBAR VRAM direct access" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.74", new[]{ " 窗口 ", " window " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.75", new[]{ "显卡页的 ReBAR 强制开启可用。", "ReBAR force-enable on the Graphics page is available." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.76", new[]{ "未在 BIOS 中启用时，ReBAR 强制开启无效，需先在 BIOS 中开启。", "While it is disabled in the BIOS, ReBAR force-enable has no effect; enable it in the BIOS first." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.77", new[]{ "AMD 平台称为 SAM，驱动侧已自动受益，无需 Pavise 干预。", "On AMD platforms this is called SAM; the driver side already benefits automatically and needs no intervention from Pavise." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.78", new[]{ "AMD 平台称为 SAM，需在 BIOS 中开启 Above 4G Decoding 与 ReBAR。", "On AMD platforms this is called SAM; enable Above 4G Decoding and ReBAR in the BIOS." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.79", new[]{ "内存", "Memory" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.80", new[]{ " GB 已用 ", " GB, used " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.81", new[]{ "可用内存偏低，大型游戏可能因内存不足而使用硬盘作为后备，造成卡顿。建议关闭部分后台程序，或启用待机内存清理。", "Available memory is low; large games may fall back to disk as memory and stutter. Close some background programs, or enable the standby memory purge." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.82", new[]{ "内存余量充足", "Plenty of memory headroom" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.83", new[]{ "已被关闭", "Disabled" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.84", new[]{ "旧优化教程常建议关闭页面文件。内存不足时，游戏将直接崩溃或退出，而非降速运行。建议在系统高级设置中交回系统管理。", "Old optimization guides commonly recommend disabling the page file. Under memory pressure, games then crash or exit outright instead of slowing down. Hand it back to system management in advanced system settings." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.85", new[]{ "由系统管理或大小正常，无需处理。", "System-managed or normally sized; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.86", new[]{ "网络链路", "Network link" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.87", new[]{ "有线", "Wired" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.88", new[]{ "无线 Wi-Fi", "Wireless (Wi-Fi)" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.89", new[]{ "有线加无线同时在线", "Wired and wireless both online" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.90", new[]{ "无线链路的延迟与突刺天然高于有线。优化策略页的无线扫描抑制可消除后台信道扫描造成的周期性突刺；条件允许时建议改用有线连接。", "A wireless link has inherently higher latency and more spikes than wired. The wireless scan suppression on the Optimization Policy page removes the periodic spikes caused by background channel scans; use a wired connection where possible." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.91", new[]{ "有线链路，延迟稳定性最佳。", "Wired link, best latency stability." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.92", new[]{ "两条链路均已连通，游戏流量走哪一条取决于系统路由。如需确保走有线，可临时关闭 Wi-Fi。", "Both links are up; which one game traffic uses depends on system routing. To ensure it uses the wired link, temporarily turn off Wi-Fi." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.93", new[]{ "供电方式", "Power source" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.94", new[]{ "外接电源", "AC power" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.95", new[]{ "电池供电", "On battery" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.96", new[]{ "笔记本已接入外接电源，性能不受电池策略限制。", "The laptop is on AC power; performance is not limited by battery policy." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.97", new[]{ "电池供电时，厂商固件通常限制 CPU 与 GPU 功耗，此状态下任何调度优化都无法补回损失的性能。请接入电源后再作对比。", "On battery, vendor firmware normally caps CPU and GPU power; in that state no scheduling optimization can recover the lost performance. Connect AC power before comparing." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.98", new[]{ "后台占用前三", "Top 3 background CPU consumers" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.99", new[]{ "最近 ", "In the last " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.100", new[]{ " 秒内 CPU 占用最高的程序。压制可从这些进程回收最多资源；需要保护的程序请加入白名单。", " seconds, the programs with the highest CPU usage. Suppression reclaims the most resources from these; add any you want protected to the whitelist." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.101", new[]{ " 加 ", " plus " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.102", new[]{ "鼠标 ", "Mouse " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.103", new[]{ "键盘 ", "Keyboard " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.104", new[]{ "蓝牙键鼠是整条延迟链上外设段唯一的两位数毫秒损失。台架实测同一只鼠标：蓝牙约 10.4 毫秒，2.4G 接收器约 3.6 毫秒，2.4G 与有线基本无差异。处理方式：改用随附的 2.4G 接收器或有线连接，该项无软件解法。", "Bluetooth keyboards and mice are the only double-digit-millisecond loss in the peripheral segment of the latency chain. Bench-verified with the same mouse: about 10.4 ms over Bluetooth versus about 3.6 ms on a 2.4G receiver, and 2.4G is essentially identical to wired. How to fix: use the bundled 2.4G receiver or a wired connection. There is no software fix." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.105", new[]{ "同时枚举到蓝牙设备与更快的连接方式，蓝牙设备可能仅配对而未实际使用。若实际使用的是蓝牙，改用 2.4G 接收器或有线连接可减少约 7 毫秒。", "Both a Bluetooth device and a faster connection were enumerated; the Bluetooth device may be paired but unused. If Bluetooth is what you actually use, a 2.4G receiver or a wired connection saves about 7 ms." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.106", new[]{ "USB 直连与 2.4G 接收器的外设延迟均在 1 至 5 毫秒，已是该段的下限，继续降低需要更换硬件。", "Direct USB and 2.4G receivers both sit at 1 to 5 ms of peripheral latency, already the floor for this segment; going lower requires different hardware." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.107", new[]{ "筛选键正开着", "Filter Keys is on" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.108", new[]{ "热键激活", "Hotkey armed" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.109", new[]{ "筛选键按微软的定义即让键盘忽略短促或重复的击键。当前每次击键需等待 ", "Filter Keys, by Microsoft's definition, makes the keyboard ignore brief or repeated keystrokes. At present every keystroke waits " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.110", new[]{ " 毫秒才被接受，是本页键鼠项中唯一可挽回两位数毫秒的一项。处理方式：在系统环境页开启「辅助功能按键拦截」。", " ms before being accepted, the only keyboard/mouse item on this page that can recover double-digit milliseconds. How to fix: enable Accessibility key interception on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.111", new[]{ "当前未造成输入延迟，但生效位或触发热键仍存在：连按五次 Shift 或长按右 Shift 八秒会在全屏游戏中弹出提示框。处理方式：在系统环境页开启「辅助功能按键拦截」一次性清除，无需管理员权限，无需重启。", "It is not adding input latency at present, but the active bits or trigger hotkeys remain: pressing Shift five times, or holding right Shift for eight seconds, raises a dialog inside a fullscreen game. How to fix: enable Accessibility key interception on the System Environment page to clear them in one pass. No administrator rights or reboot needed." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.112", new[]{ "筛选键、粘滞键与切换键均未开启，触发热键也未激活，不会拦截击键。", "Filter Keys, Sticky Keys, and Toggle Keys are all off and no trigger hotkeys are armed; keystrokes are not intercepted." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.113", new[]{ "允许挂起", "Suspend allowed" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.114", new[]{ "已禁止挂起", "Suspend disallowed" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.115", new[]{ "系统被允许在空闲后挂起键鼠所在的 USB 设备。微软的选择性暂停文档承认，退出挂起的延迟会表现为画面上的停顿。本项针对空闲后首次操作的抖动，不改善稳态延迟。处理方式：在系统环境页开启「禁止键鼠设备选择性暂停」。", "The system is allowed to suspend the USB devices hosting the keyboard and mouse after idle. Microsoft's selective-suspend documentation acknowledges that resume-from-suspend latency shows up as an on-screen pause. This addresses jitter on the first input after idle, not steady-state latency. How to fix: enable Block selective suspend for keyboard and mouse on the System Environment page." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.116", new[]{ "键鼠所在的 USB 设备均不允许省电挂起，无唤醒停顿。", "The USB devices hosting the keyboard and mouse are not allowed to power-save suspend; there are no wake-up pauses." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.119", new[]{ "键鼠队列长度被改过", "Keyboard/mouse queue length has been modified" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.120", new[]{ "ThreadDpcEnable 被写成 ", "ThreadDpcEnable was set to " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.121", new[]{ "第三方键鼠改动", "Third-party keyboard/mouse modifications" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.122", new[]{ "队列长度决定可缓存的输入条数，不决定输入的处理速度，因此调整该值不会降低延迟；调低后高回报率鼠标反而可能丢失输入。处理方式：在系统环境页开启「键鼠队列长度校正」，恢复默认值 ", "Queue length determines how many input events can be buffered, not how fast they are processed, so changing it does not reduce latency; lowering it can actually drop inputs on high polling-rate mice. How to fix: enable Keyboard/mouse queue length correction on the System Environment page to restore the default of " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.123", new[]{ "，重启后生效  ", ", effective after a reboot  " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.124", new[]{ "ThreadDpcEnable 缺少任何可信的对照测量支撑，属于优化脚本的历史遗留条目。本软件不代为修改，也不建议保留。如需清除，请手动删除 HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Session Manager\\kernel 下的 ThreadDpcEnable。", "ThreadDpcEnable has no credible controlled measurement behind it and is a legacy entry from optimization scripts. This app does not change it for you and does not recommend keeping it. To clear it, manually delete ThreadDpcEnable under HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\Session Manager\\kernel." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.125", new[]{ "HAGS 硬件加速 GPU 调度", "HAGS hardware-accelerated GPU scheduling" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.126", new[]{ "对平均帧率的影响基本落在误差范围内。其意义在于作为驱动级帧生成等功能的前置条件，关闭时这些功能不可用。修改需重启生效。", "Its effect on average frame rate falls within the margin of error. Its significance is as a prerequisite for driver-side frame generation and similar features, which are unavailable while it is off. Changes require a reboot." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.127", new[]{ "VBS 基于虚拟化的安全", "VBS virtualization-based security" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.128", new[]{ "关闭可能带来性能提升，代价是影响内存完整性，WSL2、Docker 与 Windows 沙盒均会受影响。", "Disabling it may improve performance, at the cost of Memory Integrity; WSL2, Docker, and Windows Sandbox are all affected." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.129", new[]{ "已处于关闭状态，无需处理。", "Already disabled; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.130", new[]{ "系统会在游戏期间抑制部分后台活动，保持当前状态即可。", "The system suppresses some background activity while gaming; leave it as it is." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.131", new[]{ "当前为关闭状态，常见于旧优化教程的改动。建议在系统环境页开启游戏模式守护。", "Currently disabled, a common result of old optimization guides. Enabling the Game Mode guardian on the System Environment page is recommended." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.132", new[]{ "MPO 多平面叠加", "MPO multi-plane overlay" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.133", new[]{ "已被禁用", "Disabled" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.134", new[]{ "系统默认", "System default" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.135", new[]{ "已被某个工具或手动教程关闭。画面将全部改走合成路径，录屏、直播与远程等抓屏程序也可能受影响。如需恢复默认，删除注册表 HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Dwm 下的 OverlayTestMode 并重启。", "Disabled by a tool or a manual guide. All output now goes through composition, and screen-capture programs for recording, streaming, or remote access may be affected. To restore the default, delete OverlayTestMode under HKLM\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Dwm and reboot." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.136", new[]{ "保持系统默认，本项 Pavise 不再提供开关。", "At the system default; Pavise no longer provides a switch for this item." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.137", new[]{ "Xbox Game Bar 正在后台持续录制画面并占用帧率，建议在优化策略页关闭。", "Xbox Game Bar is continuously recording in the background and costing frames; disabling it on the Optimization Policy page is recommended." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.138", new[]{ "已关闭，无需处理。", "Disabled; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.139", new[]{ "当前电源计划", "Current power plan" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.140", new[]{ "开启电源计划开关后，对局中将自动切换至高性能或卓越性能，结束后自动还原，无需手动修改。", "With the power plan switch on, the plan changes automatically to High Performance or Ultimate Performance during a match and is restored afterwards; no manual change is needed." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.141", new[]{ "陈旧覆盖 ", "Stale override " } },
            { "t.systemaudit.142", new[]{ "启动配置中存在旧教程写入的时钟覆盖。强制 HPET 在现代平台上为纯减益，点击右侧一键修复即可清除，重启后生效，可还原。", "The boot configuration contains a clock override written by an old guide. Forcing HPET is a pure loss on modern platforms. Use the one-click fix on the right to clear it; effective after a reboot and restorable." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.143", new[]{ "启动配置干净，系统使用最快的 TSC 计时。", "The boot configuration is clean; the system uses the fastest TSC timing." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.144", new[]{ "前台时间片", "Foreground time slice" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.145", new[]{ "加权不足", "Boost below documented max" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.146", new[]{ "Win32PrioritySeparation 的前台加权位低于微软文档定义的最大档，多半是被别的优化工具或教程改过。前台程序每次拿到 CPU 后能连续跑的时间不及后台应有的倍数。右侧一键修复只把这两位改成文档中的最大档，该值其余位原样保留，可还原。这一项没有降低输入延迟的实测证据，修复解决的是被改坏，不是加速。", "The foreground boost bits of Win32PrioritySeparation are below the Maximum level Microsoft documents, which usually means another optimization tool or guide changed them. Foreground programs get less consecutive CPU time relative to background than they should. The one-click fix sets only those two bits to the documented maximum and leaves every other bit of the value untouched; it is reversible. There is no measured evidence that this lowers input latency — the fix repairs a change someone else made, it does not speed anything up." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.147", new[]{ "前台加权已是微软文档定义的最大档，无需处理。", "The foreground boost is already at the Maximum level Microsoft documents; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.148", new[]{ "网络限流值", "Network throttling index" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.149", new[]{ "NetworkThrottlingIndex 已被改为非默认值。网络教程称其可优化性能，实测仅会干扰多媒体调度。点击右侧一键修复改回默认值 10，可还原。", "NetworkThrottlingIndex was changed to a non-default value. Online guides claim it improves performance; in testing it only disrupts multimedia scheduling. Use the one-click fix on the right to restore the default of 10; restorable." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.150", new[]{ "网络限流值保持系统默认，无需处理。", "The network throttling index is at the system default; no action required." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.151", new[]{ "容错堆垫片", "Fault tolerant heap shim" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.152", new[]{ "已挂载", "Attached" } },
            { "t.systemaudit.153", new[]{ "程序反复以堆损坏方式崩溃后，系统会自行给它套一层堆保护，全程不通知用户，此后每次堆分配和释放都多一点开销。点击右侧一键修复：加入系统的排除名单并摘掉注册表里指向垫片的值，垫片文件保留不删，可还原。", "After a program repeatedly crashes through heap corruption, the system quietly wraps its heap in extra protection without telling the user, adding a little overhead to every allocation and free from then on. Use the one-click fix on the right: it adds the program to the system exclusion list and removes the registry value pointing at the shim. The shim file is kept, not deleted; restorable." } },
            { "t.systemaudit.154", new[]{ "触发条件是同一程序在设定时间窗内以堆损坏或 ntdll 访问违例的方式崩溃达到设定次数，没崩过的程序不会被挂。", "It triggers when the same program crashes a set number of times within a set time window via heap corruption or an ntdll access violation. Programs that have not crashed are never shimmed." } },
